<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lijambu la Amboni ngati ejuandiki Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lijambu la Amboni ngati ejuandiki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lijambu la Amboni ngati hejuandiki Yohana ndi simu kati ji itabu nsesi yeibi mu Lilaganu Linyai ye ilandi majambu gaka Yesu Kilisitu. Kila simu kati ji itabu ye hehi bikikema “Lijambu la Amboni”. Itabu ye hehi baandika aka Matei na Maluko na Luka na Yohana baada jukukua Yesu. Lijambu la Amboni Ngati ejuandiki Yohana jwaandika ntumi Yohana pamwisu wa saka sa tisini baada juku belekwa Yesu Kilisitu. Hata naa kitabu see ngasekipwaga ntumi Yohana ndi jojukiandiki, lakini ekihandikwi kilengana ngamaa na ejiandikwi balua juutumbuli jaka Yohana na Balua japili Jaka Yohana na balua ja tatu jaka Yohana. Bandu bangi baandiki hitabu bamwandi bundongale Yohana kupwaga jwabia jutama ku musi ja Efesu kipindi se hesi, henu kuwesikana kitabu senzenu jwaandiki ku musi juku Efesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana julonge hotuhotu kupwaga kuandikwa kwikitabu senzenu kwabia kwaajangati bandu awesa kuhobale Yesu ndi Kilisitu Nkombosi, Mwana waka Sapanga jojubi mwomi, linga mulipungu la Yohana 20:31. Kupete kuhobale hela tupata womi kwii lihina laki. Kitabu senzenu saandikwi ili asoma bandu boka Ayaudi na bangaa Ayaudi. Lijambu la Amboni ejuhandiki Yohana kidogu naseilengana na Majambu gaa Sapi gangi matatu aga. Yohana juhingamaki ngani ndonduke yejutei Yesu, lakini ngase jwaandiki majambu gingi gamalenganu gajwapia Yesu. Majambu gangi gagapalika ngati kubatiswa kwaka Yesu nukulengwa kwaki kulungwenza nagombi ngasegaandikwi mu Lijambu la Amboni lendeno.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii mukutabu</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana jujitumbuli mu Lijambu la Amboni linga mulipungu laka Yohana 1:1-18</para>
  <para style="io">Ndienu juandika majambu kidogu ga ndonduke yejwatei Yesu linga mulipungu laka Yohana 1:19-12:50</para>
  <para style="io">Baada ja haga julandi majambu gingi gaka Yesu pajwabii pundema gagunhenga yesu jukuwa nukuyoka linga mulipungu laka Yohana 13:1-20:31</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana jujomule Lijambu la Asapi laki mulipungu laki la 21 koni julandi kipindi gumu Yesu pajwaapitila bandu baada jukuyoka kwaki kabee julandi ndaba jaki jukuandika kitabu senze.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Lilobi lahengika kuba mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Pakwatumbuliya kwabiya ni Lilobi, ni lilobi heli labiya kwaka Sapanga nalombi ndi labiya Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Toka pu utumbuli jakabii pamu na Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Kupete jombi, Sapanga jabomba hindu yoti, wala nga sindu sokapi sesabombika sanga jombi. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Jombi ndi utumbulii gwa womi, na womi gola guletiki unang'anu kwa bandu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Unang'anu gola gwanang'ana pa lwii, na lwii ngaselwawesiki kususua.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Sapanga antuma mundu jumu, lihina laki Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Hoju jahika kaapwagi bandu majambu gu unang'anu. Jahika ili bandu boka ajoana malobi gaki nu kunhobale. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Yohana we hoju ngasejabii unang'anu gola, lakini jahika pee kaapwagi bandu kupete unang'anu gola. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Gongo ndi unang'anu wa sakaka, goguhika pundema pani, kwaanang'anii bandu boka.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Ndienu Lilobi jabii pundema nu kupete jombi, Sapanga jabomba nndema hogu, lakini bandu bupundema ngasebummanyiki. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Jahika kwa bandu baki, lakini bandu baki ngasebunzopike. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Lakini boka babunzopa, ndi bala babuhobali, jaapekia uwesu gakuba bana baka Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Bababi bana baka Sapanga nga ngati easaliwa bandu bangi, ngasebasaliwi ngati mundu ejupala ila ngati ejupala Sapanga, ila Sapanga mweni babii Atati babu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Lilobi jwabiya mundu, jwatama pamu natwepani. Natwepani tugubona ukolongu waki, ulumbii waki jombi jojubii Mwana wakajika wa Atati a Sapanga, jutweli wamboni na sakaka.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yohana jaapwajila bandu majambu gaki, japwaga sukujamali, “Jonzo ndi jonapwaga majambu gaki panapwaga, ‘Juhika mundu jumu munyuma jangu nkolongu kupeta nepani, ndaba jabii kabula jukusaliwa nepani.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Ngati ejubii jwaamboni ngamaa, natwepani kuhuma kwaki tujopiki mbenge hingi ngamaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Ndaba Sapanga japia Malagalakilo kupete Musa, lakini umboni waka Sapanga na usakaka yahika kwii indela jaka Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Nga mundu joambweni Sapanga. Lakini Mwana wa kajika, jojubii Sapanga jojupaliwi na Atati baki, jonioju ndi jojutupwagi majambu gaka Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Majambu gaka Yohana mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matei 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Ganga ndi malobi gaka Yohana gajaapwagila aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi buku Yelusalemu pababi baatumiki kwaki agolu na Alawi ili bundalukiya, “Boo we wa nyanye?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Yohana ngasejakaniki kujibu liswali lela, ila japwaga pee hotuhotu, “Nepani nga ni Kilisitu nkombosi?”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Ndienu bundalukiya, “Boo henu we wanyanye? Boo weapa lee wa Elia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana jajibua, “Nganenga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Bundalukiya babe, “Boo Mlota waka Sapanga jola ndi lee weapa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana jajibua, “Nganenga!”<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Henu bupwagila, “Henu we wanyanye? Boo gupwaga bole kuhusu wamwete? Utupwagila ili tujenda takapwagila bala babututumiki.”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yohana japwaga, “Nepani ndi jojanongaliya Mlota Isaya pajapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Mundu jujamali pulukoba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Mujinyosa indela jaka Bambu.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Likundi laka Afalisayu ndi bababii baatumiki bandu haba, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>bundalukiya Yohana, “Ana we nga wa Kilisitu wala nga wa Elia, wala nga u Mlota, henu ndaba ja kii gutenda kabatisa bando?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yohana jajibua, “Nepani numbatisa kwa masi. Lakini pikilanda jinu jubii mundu mwanganya ngasemumanyike. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Jojuhika munyuma jangu hoju, nepani ngasembalika hata kukonga lunyusi lwii latu saki.”<figure style="fig" alt="A person wearing sandals" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Mundu juwata ilatu</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Majambu haga gahengika ku musi uku Betania kwii ja losi luku Yoludani, kojabii Yohana jwakabatisa bandu.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Likondoo waka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Lisoba la pili Yohana ambona Yesu akuhikila, japwaga, “Linga lende ndi, Mwana Likondoo waka Sapanga, jojuijukua mahakau ga bandu bupundema! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Jonzo ndi jonalandila majambu gaki kupwaga, ‘Jwiihika mundu munyuma jango ndi jombi nkolongu kupeta nepani, ndaba jombi jabii kabula nepani ngasenzaliwi.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Nenamwete ngasenumanyiki, lakini nahika kabatisa bandu kwa masi ili bandu buku Izilaeli amanya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Yohana japwaga kabee gala gajagabona, “Nijimbweni Loho jaka Sapanga jakahuluka ngati ngunda kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga nukutama panani jaki. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Wala nepani ngasenumanyiki, lakini jombi jojandumiki kubatisa bandu kwa masi, jombi jambwajila, ‘Mundu jowambona Loho jakahuluka nukutama panani jaki, hoju ndi jojubatisa kwa Loho jaka Sapanga.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Yohana japwagaa, “Numbweni, kabee numpwaji jonujuwe ndi Mwana waka Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Banafunzi bakwanza baka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Kilabu jaki Yohana jabii jujemiki papuje kabee pamu na banafunzi baki abeli, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>eambona Yesu jakapeta japwaga, “Linga, lende ndi Mwana Likondoo laka Sapanga!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Banafunzi abeli bala bunzowini Yohana ejapwaga malobi gala, bajenda pamu na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesu ejang'alumbuka, jabona bukunzengaliya, jaapwagila, “Ntaputa kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Nabombi bunzibua, “Labi maana jaki Mbola, gutama kwako?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Yesu jaapwajila, “Nhikaniya nanamu nndinga.” Banafunzi bala bajendaniya balinga pajutama, ndaba sabii saa komi pakamii, batama kwaki lisoba lela.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Andilea, mmbeli waka Simoni Petili, jakabii jumu ja abeli bala babunzowa Yohana jakapwaga ganga nukujenda na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Sindu sa kwanza sejahenga Andilea sabiya kuntaputa nndonguwaki joakema Simoni nukupwagi, “Tumbweni Masia.” Ndi kupwaga, “Kilisitu Nkombosi” <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Ndipala ampelika Simoni kwaka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Najombi Yesu andingaliya nukupwagi, “Weapa wa Simoni mwana waka Yohana, nawe bagukema wa Kefa.” Kefa kukigiliki Petili maana jaki “Lilibu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jakema Pilipi na Nataneli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Kilabu jaki Yesu japala kujenda ku musi uku Galilaya. Najombi ambona Pilipi, Yesu apwagila, “Gumbwata nenga!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Pilipi jabii mundu juku Betisaida mwenei jwa musi kobabiya atama Andilea na Petili. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Ndipala Pilipi ataputa Nataneli, naeambona ampwagila, “Tumbweni mundu jola joahandiki Musa mukutabu sa Malagalaki, na alota baka Sapanga babahandiki majambu gaki, hoju ndi Yesu mwana waka Josepu, kuhuma ku musi uku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Nataneli andalukiya Pilipi, “Boo sindu sa sapi kihuma ku Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Pilipi ampwagila, “Hika gulinga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Ndipala Yesu ambona Nataneli jakahika kwaki, jakalandila majambu gaki, “Linga hoju Mwizilaeli wa sakaka ngasejubii niisoli nkati jake!”<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Nataneli andalukiya, “Gumanyiki kwa bolee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu anzibua, “Kabula Pilipi ngasejugu kemiki, nugubweni pawabii pai ju nkongu wu ntini.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Nataneli ampwagila kabee, “Mbola, weapa wa Mwana waka Sapanga, weapa ndi wa Bambu nkolongu uku Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesu jajibua, “Boo guhobali ndaba nugupwaji nugubweni pawabii pai junkongu gu nkoju? Wagabona majambu makolongu kupeta ganga.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Yesu jajonzukiya kupwaji, “Numpwaji sakaka, mwakubona kunani kwaka Sapanga kwakahoguka na Atumi bu kunani kwaka Sapanga bakakwela nukuhuluka panani jaka Mwana waka Mundu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Bandu atogule ndoa ku Musi uku Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Lisoba la tatu kwabia nu kutogule ndoa ku Musi uku Kana, ku nkoa uku Galilaya. Amabaka Yesu nabombi babii, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>najombi Yesu babii bunkokiki ku kutogule ndoa pamu na banafunzi baki. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Divai ejajomuka, amabaka Yesu bumpwagila, “Ngaseabi na divai!”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Lakini Yesu jaapwagila, “Mwiimbwagi sukuhenga. Lisaa la lakona ngaselihikike.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Ndienu amabaka Yesu baapwagila atumisi, “Lokapi lejwaampwagila, mwihengaje.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Papuje jabii milundu sita jealenganaki kwa malibu, kila gumu gwawesa kutoto madebi gabeli au gatatu ga masi. Babia abei papu ndaba mihilu jeapwata Ayaudi ndaba jukulisapisa ili kundumbali Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesu jaapwagila atumisi, “Ntwelakiya milundu jenze masi.” Nabombi batwelakiya twee. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Ndienu Yesu jaapwagila, “Nteka henu masi haga mupelakiya nkolongu wa tipati ga ndoa.” Batenda ngati Yesu ejalagalakiya, <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>nkolongu jola ejaonza masi gala kumbi gabiya gang'anambwiki kuba divai, nkolongu jola ngasejamanyiki pandu kojahuma divai, lakini atumisi babateka masi bamanyiki. Ndienu akema mwanalomi jojutola mbomba jola, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>ampwagila, “Kila mundu jutumbuli kupia divai jejinoi oti, na bandu naanywii nakanopi ndi apia jejinyolwi. Lakini wehapa gubei divai jejinoga mbaka sajenu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesu jahenga nginyuli ja kwanza ku Kana kunkoa uku Galilaya, jalangila ukolongu waki na banafunzi baki batenda kunhobale.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Egapeta ganiaga, Yesu jahuluka pamu na amabu na alongu baki na banafunzi baki, nukujenda kumusi uku Kapelinaumu kokuje batemi masoba masokopi.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mu Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12">Matei 21:12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maluko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Lisoba likolongu lukutogule Pasaka ja Ayaudi lihegali, Yesu jakwela kujenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Jakolila bandu ku Nyumba jaka Sapanga bakalombisa ng'ombi na makondoo na ngunda na bangi abadilisa lupija koni atemi mmesa yabu.<figure style="fig" alt="A business person who exchanges money" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Bandu baabadilisa lupija</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Ndipala japota lugoji kuba ngati kiboku na kwaabenga boka kuhuma mu Nyumba jaka Sapanga pamu na ng'ombi na makondoo gabu. Ndipala japendua mesa ya bandu babadilisa lupija nukujiti mangengalema ge pai, <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>jaapwajila bababia alombesa ngunda, “Mmboa hindu aye pamba. Mwajihenga nyumba ja Atati bangu kuba guliu!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Banafunzi baki bakombuka Maandiku ga Sapi gapwaga, “Mwaa Sapanga upali wangu gu nyumba jaku guindenda kundinyi ngati mwotu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Ndienu Ayaudi bangi bumpwajila, “Witenda nginyuli boo, kulangi gubii nu uwesu gukuhenga majambu ge haga?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesu jajibua, “Mmbombula Nyumba jaka Sapanga jenze, nane najisenga kabee kwa masoba matato.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Ayaudi bumpwajila, “Nyumba jaka Sapanga jeze basenga kwa kipindi sa yaka alobaini na sita, nawehapa wisenga boo kwa masoba matatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Lakini Nyumba jaka Sapanga jejabiya julongale Yesu, jabiya nhyega jaki. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Yesu ejayoka, banafunzi baki bakombuka jabiya juwaiki kulongale lijambu le heli, ndienu bahobaliya Maandiku ga Sapi na malobi gajabiya jupwagiki Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jumanyiki mioju ja bandu boti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Yesu pajwabii ku Yelusalemu ku tipati ja Pasaka. Bandu bingi bahobalii pababona nginyuli yejabii juhengiki. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Lakini Yesu ngasejaahobali bandu bala ndaba jaamanyiki boka. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Jombi ngasejapai mundu jokapi ampwagila majambu ga bandu bala ndaba jaamanyiki sapi gagabii nkati ja mioju jabu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Jabii kilongosi jumu Nhyaudi joankemika Nikodemu, jojuhumiki mwikikundi sa Afalisayu. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Lisoba limu Nikodemu anzendila Yesu ikilu nu kumpwaji, “Mbola, tumanyiki wehapa ummbola jugutumiki Sapanga kutubola, ndaba nga mundu jojuwesa kuhenga nginyuli yeguhenga ila ana Sapanga jubii najombi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesu anzibua, “Nugupwagi sakaka, ana mundu ngasejusaliwi mala ja pili, ngajuwesi kugubona Ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodemu anndalukiya, “Mundu juwesa boo kubelekwa koni msejaa? Ngajiwesi kujingi mulutumbu ja amabaki nu kubelekwa kabee!”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Nugupwagi sakaka, mundu na ngasejubelikwi kwa masi na Loho jaka Sapanga, ngajuwesi kujingi mu ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Mundu jubelekwa koni jubii na nhyega kuhuma kwa amabu baki na atati baki, lakini mundu jubelekwa loho kwa loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Guisangaa ndaba nugupwaagi kupalika kubelekwa mala ja pili. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Nhwahi gupoga pandu pagupala, nawenga gujowa kupoga kwaki, lakini ngasegumanyiki pandu paguhuma wala pagujenga. Ndi ekukuba kwa kila mundu ejibelekwa kwa Loho jaka Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodemu andalukiya Yesu, “Malobi ge haga gawesikana bole?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Wehapa wogubii gu mbola nkolongu uku Izilaeli, ngasegumanyiki majambu haga? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Nugupwaji sakaka, twepani tupwaaga gatugamanyi nu tupwaga gatagabweni, lakini mwabangi ngasempai kujetake malobi gitu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Ana malobi gupundema pani numpwagi ngasenhobali, mwihobale boo ananupwagi majambu gu kunani kwaka Sapanga? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Ngasejubii mundu jojuwahiki kujenda kunani kwaka Sapanga, ila pee Mwana waka Mundu jojahuluka kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Ngati Musa ejilitondabiya lijoka la shaba lela panani ja ndonga kulukoba, ndi ahelahela Mwana waka Mundu ebuntondabiya kunani, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>ili kila mundu joanhobale jubiya na womi wa masoba goha. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Ndaba Sapanga jaapai ngamaa bandu bupundema hata jaamua kumpia Mwana waki wakanzika, ili kila mundu joanhobaale ngajikuwe ila jubiya na womi wa masoba goha. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Ndaba Sapanga ngaseantumiki Mwana waki puundema ili jutemula bandu bupundema, ila jaakombula.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Joanhobale Mwana waka Sapanga ngasejuhukumiwa, lakini jwanga kunhobale tayali buntemwi, ndaba ngaseahobali Mwana wakanzika waka Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Kutemu je ndi kongo, unang'anu guhikiki pundema, lakini bandu bulupala lwii kuliku unang'anu, ndaba ahenga mahakau. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Kila mundu jojuhenga mahakau jugusuki unang'anu, najombi jukana kuhika ku unang'anu ili mahengu gaki giibonikana. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Lakini bahenga ga sakaka ahika pu unang'anu ili mahengu gabu gabonikana ahengiki sukunzoane Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mmbatisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Ebajomula ganiaga Yesu na banafunzi baki bajenda ku nkoa uku Yudea, batama nabu kola kipindi kisokopi, koni jakabatisa bandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Yohana jabiya jakabatisa ku Ainoni, pambipi nuku Salimu, ndaba kola gakabii masi gingi. Bandu bunzendila najombi nakabatisa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Ganiaga gapitila kabula Yohana ngaseanzegi mukipungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Gwapitila ubisi kati ja banafunzi bangi baka Yohana nu nhyuda jumu kuhusu mihilu jeakamulaki Ayaudi jukusamba masi mumaboku na mumagolu asapisika ndaba jukundumbali Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Ndienu anzendila Yohana nukumpwajila, “Mbola, gunkomboka mundu jola jojabii pamu nawe kwii juku losi luku Yoludani, jowabii gulonge naku jola, henu najombi jutenda kubatisa, na bandu boka atenda kunzende.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yohana ampwagila, “Mundu ngasejuwesa kuba na sindu ana Sapanga ngaseampeki. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Mwabe mmanyiki panapwaga, ‘Nepani nga na Kilisitu Nkombose, lakini andumiki ili nundonguliyaje.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Mmbomba jobuntola ndi waka bambu jojutola, lakini nkosi waka bambu jojutola jujema pambipi nukunzowane, jutogule ngamaa paanzowane sauti jaka bambu jojutola mmbomba. Ndienu kutogule kwangu ekutimii. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Yesu jupalika kuba nkolongu ngani nane miya nsokopi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jojuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Jojuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga ndi nkolongu kupeta boka. Jojuhuma pundema ndi jupundema, na julongale malobi gupundema. Lakini jojuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga ndi julongosa gooka. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Jombi julongale gajagabweni nakaga jowa, lakini nga mundu jojujetake gajagalongale. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Jokapi jojujetake kulongale kwaki jujetake Sapanga ndi sakaka. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Joantumiki Sapanga jupwaga malobi gaka Sapanga ndaba antwelake Loho jaki kupeta kipemo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Atati bumpahi Mwana, najombi ampeki hindu yoti mwamaboku gaki. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Joanhobale Mwana jubii na womi wa masoba goka, jwanga kunhobale Mwana ngajukubi na womi ila Sapanga anhyomila ngamaa masoba goti.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nu mmbomba Nsamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Afalisayu bajowana Yesu jupata banafunzi bingi nukubatisa kupeta Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Lakini Yesu wee ngasejabatisi mundu ila banafunzi baki ndi bababiya bakabatisa bandu. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Ndienu Yesu pajajowa haga jaboka ku Yudea nukukelubuki ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Ejwabiya mwiindela kujenda ku Galilaya kwapalika jupetila ku Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Jahika ku Sikali musi gumu gogubii ku Samalia, pambipi nilituhi laka Yakobo leampeki mwana waki, joakema Josepu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Papuje sakabii kiliba saka Yakobu, Yesu jaatama pulutengu jikiliba, ndaba jabii jusokiki nukujenda. Papuje sabiya kiegali saa sita liyoba mutu.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Ndienu jahika mbomba jumu Nsamalia kuteka masi na Yesu ampwagila, “Nagumbeke masi ngunywi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Kipindi se sela banafunzi baki bapiti ku musi kulomba kilebi.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Lakini mmbomba Nsamalia ampwagila Yesu, “Kubii bole weapa u Yaudi kunoba ne masi kipindi ne nu Msamalia?” Ndaba Ayaudi ngaseajongana na Asamalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Ana wakamanyiki hindu yejupia Sapanga, kabee na ukummanyiki jojuguloba masi ga kunywa hoju, weapa ndi ukundoba, najombi jukugupekia masi gagaleta womi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Mmbomba jola ampwagila, “Bambu, weapa ngasegubi na sindu sukuteke masi ni kiliba se seno kilasu ngamaa. Henu gwipata kwaa, masi ga womi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Wele ulibona gu nkolongu kupeta atati bitu Ayakobo? Jombi jutupekia twepani kiliba senze, mweni na bana baki ni mipugu jaki bakunywa masi jikiliba senze?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesu ampwagila. “Kila mundu jojukunywa masi ganga ngajilijowane nywita kabee, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>lakini jokapi jojikunywa masi ganampekia nepani ngajunkamwi nywita masoba goha. Masi ganumpekia gibiya nkati jaki ngati kiliba sa masi ga womi gajapekia womi wa masoba goha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Mmbomba jola ampwagila, “Bambo, gumbekia masi haga ili niibona nywita kabee, nihika kabee pamba kuteka masi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Jenda kunkema nndomi waku, guhika naku pamba.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Mmbomba jola ampwagila, “Nepani ngase mii na mwanalome.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu ampwagila, “Gupwajiki sakaka ngasegubii na mwanalome. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Ndaba wabii nakanalomi anhwano, na mwanalomi jogutama naku sajenu nga wako. Henu gupwajiki sakaka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Mmbomba jola japwaga, “Bambo, nee mona weapa umlota waka Sapanga.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>“Aka hoku bitu bundumbaliya Sapanga kukitombi senze, lakini mwa Ayaudi mwee mpwaga ku Yelusalemu ndi pandu papalika kungungamali Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Amabo, guhobalya senumpwagi, gihika masoba ngamwalumbali Atati kukitombi ase, wala ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Mwasamalia mwanganya munzinamii sapanga jwanga kummanya, lakini twepani tumanyiki jotunzinamii, ndaba ukombosi guhuma kwa Ayahude. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Lakini sihika kipindi, kabee tayali kihiki, kipindi se hesi bandu balumbali sakaka balumbaliya Atati sukulongoswa kwa Loho jaka Sapanga na sakaka. Ndaba Atati apala bandu babundumbali kwii ndela heji. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Sapanga ndi Loho, nabombi babunzinamii kupalika kunzinamii kwa Loho jaka Sapanga na sakaka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Mbomba jola ampwagila, “Numanyiki Masia jobukema Kilisitu Nkombosi, jutenda kuhika, nikipindi sejihika jutupwajila kila sindu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Nepani nenonge nawe, ndi Masiya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Muda agolagola banafunzi baka Yesu batenda kuhika, nabombi basangii kumbona jakalongila numbomba. Lakini nga jumu kati ja banafunzi bala joandalukiya mmbomba jola, “Gupala kike?” Wala nga jumu joandalukiya Yesu, “Ndabaja kii gulonge nu mmbomba ajojo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Ndienu mmbomba jola juguleka nndundu waki wa masi, jajenda ku musi, kalandi bandu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Uhikaniya mumbona mundu jojumpwaji majambu goka gahengiki. Boo kuwesikana jonzo ndi wa Kilisituje?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Ndipala bandu bapita mmusi gola nukunzende Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Kipindi se sela banafunzi baki bundoba Yesu bakapwaga, “Mbola, kulaa kilebi!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Lakini jaapwagila, “Nepani mii ni kilebi sangakukimanya mwanganya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Ndipala banafunzi batumbuliya kulaluana, “Boo jubii mundu joandeti kilebe?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Kilebi sangu nenga ndi kuhenga sejupala jola jojundumiki nukujomo lihengu laki. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Mmbanganya uyobali kupwaga, ‘Jihigali miehi nsese pee kuhika masoba gukuhusa.’ Lakini nenupwagi, nndingaliya mwagabona matuhi egabii tayali kuhusa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Jojuhusa jukuba jujopiki nsalaha najombi jukusanya ilebi kwa ajili ja womi wa masoba goha, ndi jojupanda na jojuhusa bitoguliya pamu. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Kwa ndaba heji malobi ganga ga sakaka, ‘Mundu jumu jutenda kupanda na jongi jutenda kuhusa apwaga sakaka.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Nepani nutumiki mwanganya kutuhi kuhusa ilebi yeyuye mwanganya ngasemwapandike, bangi bahengiki lihengu lukupanda lakini mwanganya uhusa ilebi yeapandiki bangi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Asamalia bingi ba musi gola buhobali Yesu ndaba ja malobi gajapwaga mmbomba jola, “Jambwajila majambu goka ganabii nagahengiki.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Ndipala Asamalia pabuhikila Yesu, bundoba jutama nabu pamu, najombi jatama kola masoba mabele.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Bandu bingi ngamaa buhobali Yesu ndaba ja malobi gaka mmbomba jola. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Bandu be haba bumpwajila mmbomba jola, “Henu tuhobali ila nga ndaba ja malobi gaku pena, ndaba twepani twabeti kabee tumanyiki sakaka jonzo ndi Nkombosi jupundema poti.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamisa mwana waka kilongosi jumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Pagapeta masoba mabeli, Yesu jaboka kola jajenda ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Ndaba mweni Yesu japwaga bila kuhiya, “Mlota ngasejujetakeka mmusi waki mwene.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Ndienu pajwahika ku Galilaya benei bunzopiki, ndaba bagabweni majambu goha gajahenga Yesu ku Yelusalemu kwa tipati ja Pasaka.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Ndienu Yesu jakelubuka kabee ku musi uku Kana gogubii ku Galilaya, pandu pajang'alumbua masi kuba divai. Kola jwabii kilongosi jwakabii na mwana nngonzu musi uku Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Kilongosi jola ejwajowana Yesu juhikiki ku Galilaya kuhuma ku Yudea, anzendila Yesu ahingamakiya jujenda akundamisa mwana waki jojabii lahilahi. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Ana ngasembweni nginyuli na ndonduke ngauhobalele Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Kilongosi jola ampwagila, “Bambo, nuguloba guhika kwangu kabula mwanawango ngasejuwile.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Jenda pena mwana waku julamike!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Mundu jola jaamua kuhobale lilobi laka Yesu lejwapwaga najombi jaamua kubuja. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Pajwabii mwindela jaketangana na atumisi baki bumpwajila, “Mwanawaku we mwomi!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Jombi jalalukiya saa kike mwana wa pajatumbuliya kuba sapi, nabombi bumpwagila, “Jombi jalama saa saba lioba mutu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Ndienu atati bala bakombuka muda ngati agolagola Yesu pabumpwajila, “Mwana waku julamike.” Ndipala jombi na akakosi baki buhobaliya Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Heji ndi nginyuli jukusangasa ja pili jejahenga Yesu pajabiya juhuma ku Yudea jujenda ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamisa nngonzu pilitanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Pagapeta haga Yesu jajenda ku Yelusalemu ku tipati gangi ga Ayaudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Ku Yelusalemu kola, pambipi nu litanga lu kujingali pa musi gobugukema litanga lilikondoo labiya litanda likolongu la masi lebikikema kiebulania Betizata, litanda heli labiya ni indamba unhwano yunu ugolu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Mwindamba ye mola batemi agonzu bingi, babi bangalinga na akilema na balei. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Boti babiya alendale masi gatimbulikana ndaba kila mala mtumi juku nani kwaka Sapanga jwahika kutimbu masi mlitanda. Mundu jokapi jojabi jwa kwanza kujingi mlitanda baada juntumi waka Sapanga kugatimbu masi, julamika ugonzu wokapi gojubinaku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nsitali gongo ngasegupatikana mumahandiku ga mwandi.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Papuje jabii mundu jumu jojabii julehi muda wa yaka selasini na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesu paambona nngonzu jola jugoni pala jamanyiki mundu jola jabii nngonzu jwa muda wa masoba gingi andalukiya, “Gupala lee kulama?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Nngonzu jola ampwagila, “Bambu, nandi ngasemi na mundu jukunyingi mmasi kipindi masi egakuba agatimbwilini, kila enenga kujingi mundu jongi jundenda kunongule.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesu apwagila, “Jema ulitweka kipega saku gujenda.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Apalapa mundu jola jatenda kulama, jajukua, kipega saki nukutumbuli kujenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Lisoba le lela labiya Lisoba lu Kupomulela. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Ndi Ayaudi bangi bumpwagila mundu jojulamiki we jola, “Lelenu Lisoba lu Kupomulela Malagi gi mihilu jitu ngasegutupala kutoto kipega.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Lakini jombi jaapwagila, “Mundu jola jojunamisi ndi jojumbwajila, ‘Jukua kipega saku gujenda.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Nabombi bundalukiya, “Mundu jojugupwaji, jukua kipega saku gujenda, jonujuwe nyanye?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Lakini jombi ngaseamanyiki mundu joandamisi ndi nyaa, ndaba Yesu jabii tayali juboi, ndaba papuje wabii nsambi wa bandu nkolongu.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Ndienu monikatae, Yesu ankolila mundu we jola mu Nyumba jaka Sapanga apwagila, “Henu gulamiki, guihenga mahakau kabee, guipata lijambu likolongu ngani.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Mundu jola jajenda nakapwaji aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi Yesu ndi jojunamisi. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Ndaba Yesu jahengiki lijambu lela Lisoba lu Kupomulela, Ayaudi batumbuliya kusumbuu. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Ndienu Yesu jaapwagila, “Atati bangu ahenga lihengu masoba goti, nane henga ahelahela.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Ndaba ja malobi haga, akikilongosi ba Ayaudi bataputa indela jukunkoma Yesu, nga ndaba jukuhalabana Malagi gi Lisoba lu Kupomulela pee, ila kabee ndaba japwaga Sapanga ndi Atati baki, nukulibona julengini na Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uwesu waka mwana waka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nupwaji sakaka, Mwana ngasejuwesa kuhenga sindu kajika jaki juwesa pee kuhenga sindu sejaabona Atati bakahenga. Ndaba seahenga Atati Mwana najombi juhenga aselasela. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Atati bupala Mwana, nukundangi kila sindu sejuhenga mweni, kabee bundangia majambu makolongu kupeta haga, nanamu mwitenda kusangaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Ngati Atati ejaayoha bandu bawii nakapeke womi, ahelahe na Mwana japeke womi bandu bajapai. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Atati ngaseantemu mundu jokapi lakini ampeki Mwana uwesu woka gukutemu bandu, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>ili bandu boka babunzoane Mwana ngati ebajoane Atati. Janga kunzoane Mwana ngasejajoane Atati babuntumiki.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“Numpwaji sakaka, jojujoane lilobi langu nukuhobale jojundumiki, jubii na womi wa masoba goha. Jombi ngajwiitemuliwe, ila julobwiki kuhuma ku kuwa nukujingi kuwomi wa masoba goha. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Nupwaji sakaka, kihika kipindi kabee kihikiki tayali bandu ba wii bijowana malobi gaka Mwana waka Sapanga, na bandu babijowana biibiya bomi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Ngati Atati ebi utumbuli wa womi, ndi ahelahela ampeki Mwana uwesu ukupia womi kwa bandu. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Kabee ampeki Mwana uwesu ukutemu, ndaba jombi ndi Mwana waka Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Wisangaa ndaba ja malobi ganga, ndaba kihika kipindi bandu boka babii kutenge bijowana malobi gaki, <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>nabombi bitenda kuyoka. Baahengiki ga amboni bitenda kuyoka nukupata womi, lakini baahengiki giliya bitenda kuyoka nukutemuliwa.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jililongale mweni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Nepani ngasenhwesa kuhenga sindu ku uwesu wangu na mwete. Nepani ndemu ngati enyowana kutemu kwa Atati, nu kutemu kwangu kwa sakaka. Ndaba nga kukupala namweti ila kukupala kwa jola jojundumiki.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>Nanililongali namweti malobi gangu ngagiwesi kujetakeka kuba ga sakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Lakini jubi jongi jojupia malobi gango, nane manyiki goka gajunongale nepani ga sakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Mwanganya mwaatuma bandu kwaka Yohana Mmbatisa, najombi jalongila sakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Nepani ngasenhobale malobi gala gaapwaga bandu, ila mbwaga malobi ganga ili mpata kuokolewa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yohana jabii ngati taa jejabi jinyaka nukumulika, nanamu mwabi mwasagula kutogule unang'anu we hogu kwa masoba masokopi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Lakini malobi gaganongale nepani gabi nuukolongu ngamaa kupeta gaka Yohana. Ndaba mahengu ganihenga ndi mahengu gambeki Atati nagajomula, galangi Atati ndi bandumiki. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Atati baandumiki ndi jojaapwagi bandu majambu gangu. Kyee mwanganya ngasenzoini sauti jaki kwa makutu ginu wala kummbona ejubii, <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>wala lilobi laki ngaselitama nkati jinu, ndaba ngase munhobali jola joantumike. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Mwanganya nsoma ngamaa Maandiku ga Sapi uwasali nkati jaki mwipata womi wa masoba goha. Lakini mahandiku ge gaga ganongale nepani! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Lakini mwanganya ngasempai kuhika kwangu nepani ili mpata womi wa masoba goha.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“Nepani ngasendaputa bandu buku numbalila. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Lakini numanyiki mwanganya ngasemmbii nu upali waka Sapanga nkati jinu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Nepani hikiki kuuwesu Atati bango, lakini ngasennyopa. Ila mundu jongi najuhikiki kupete uwesu wakimweni mwitenda kunzopa. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Henu nhwesa boo kunhobale kipindi mwanganya mpala kujopa ulumbi kuhuma kwinu mwabeti, lakini ngasentaputa ulumbi kuhuma kwaka Sapanga jojubii kajika? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Mwiwasali nepani ndi nenantakila kwa Atati. Musa jomuhobali ndi jojuntakila mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Ana sakaka munhobali Musa, mwakahobaliya nane, Ndaba Musa jaandika majambu gango. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Lakini ngasemwagahobale ga juandiki, boo mwiwesa boo kuhobalee malobi gango?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu japeke bandu posu elupu uhwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:3-21">Matei 14:3-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Ndienu Yesu jajenda kwii ju nhanga uku Galilaya gobugukema Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Nsambi nkolongu wa bandu watenda kumpwata, ndaba bigibweni nginyuli jejabii juhengi kalamisa agonzu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesu jakwela kukitombi jatama pai pamu na banafunzi baki. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Kipindi sa tipati ja Pasaka ja Ayaudi jabiya jiegali. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesu ejalinga jugubona nsambi wa bandu gukuhikila, andalukiya Pilipi, “Tukalomba kilebi kwako ili tuwesa kapeke bandu ababa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Japwaga sanahuli ili kundenga Pilipi, ndaba jombi mweni jamanyiki semusijuhenga.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Pilipi apwagila, “Hata tulombi mabumunda kwi ipandi mia mbili ja feza ngagatosi, kila jumu mwisijupata kidogu pena.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Mbolee waki jumu joakema Andilea, ndongu waka Simoni Petili, ampwagila, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Jubii pamba mwana jumu jubii na mabumunda ga shaili uhwanu na homba ibeli. Lakini yeniye ngaseitosa kwa bandu boka haba.”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesu japwaaga, “Mwatamika pai bandu haba.” Napandu jepala pakabi na manyonyoli gingi. Ndipala bandu babatamiki bakabii akanalomi elupu uhwano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesu jajukua mabumunda gala, ansengula Sapanga, nakapeke banafunzi baki abaga kwa bandu babatemi pala. Najahenga ahelahe kwa homba yela, kila mundu japata ngati ejapala. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Bandu pabatupila, Yesu jaapwagila banafunzi baki, “Nkusanya hipandi yeihigali hiiyooba.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Ndipala bakusanya hipandi ya mabumunda ga shaili yebahigaki, nukutwelake hitonga komi ni ibeli.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Bandu ebabona nginyuli yaka Yesu ejalangia, bapwaga, “Sakaka mundu jonzo ndi mlota jola jojuhika pani puundema!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesu pajamanya bandu bapala kunzuku ili kumbeka jubiya bambu nkolongu, jaboka kabee kajika jaki kujenda ku kitombi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jujenda panani ja masi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matei 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Pakwabiya pakamii banafunzi baka Yesu bahuluka kujenda kunhanga, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>bakwela munhwatu ili alombuka nhanga kujenda ku Kapelinaumu. Lwii lwabiya lujingi na Yesu jabiya ngasejahiki bombi. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Apalapa kimbonga satumbuliya kupoga nuku ukologa nhanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Pabahika ulasu wa kilumita nhwanu au sita bumbona Yesu jakajenda panani ja masi, jakaegaliya punhwatu, henu batenda kujogopa ngamaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Lakini Yesu jaapwagila, “Nepane, mwijogopa!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Bunkalibisa jujingala nkati ju nhwatu, apalapa nhwatu wahika pulutengu jundema kobaabiya apala kujenda.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu buntaputa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Kilabu jaki nsambi wa bandu gogwahigali upandi gongi gu unhanga bamanya gwabii nhwatu gumwa pee, kabee Yesu ngasejajingala munwatu gola pamu na banafunzi baki, ila banafunzi baki bajenda kajika jabu. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Ndienu jahika minhwatu jengi kuhuma ku Tibelia mbaki pambipi na pandu pala pababiya akula mabumunda, kipindi Yesu pajabiya ansengwi Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Ndienu nsambi wa bandu pabamanya Yesu na banafunzi baki ngaseabi pala, bajingala minhwatu kujenda ku Kapelinaumu kuntaputa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi posu jejutupeke womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Bandu bala bunkolila Yesu kwii ju nhanga, bundalukiya, “Mbola, gwahika pamba kipindi bole?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesu japwaga, “Numpwaji sakaka, mwanganya ndaputa nga ndaba mwabweni nginyuli, ila ndaba mwalii mabumunda gala nukutupi. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Mwakihenge lihengu kilebi sekibohi, lakini mukihengila lihengu kilebi sekitama masoba goha ndaba ja womi wa masoba goha. Jenze ndi posu jejuje Mwana waka Mundu jitenda kumpeke, ndaba Sapanga, Atati jutei kunhagu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Ndipala bandu bundalukiya, “Tuhenga kike ili tupata kuhenga mahengu gajupala Sapanga?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesu japwaga, “Lende ndi lihengu lejupala Sapanga nhenga, kunhobe joantumike.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Ndienu bundalukiya, “Wiihenga nginyuli boo ili tubona tuwesa kuguhobalela? Gwihenga sindu bole? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Aka hoku bitu bakula posu jebijikema mana kulukoba, ngati ebaandiki mu Maandiku ga Sapi gagapwaga, ‘Jaalea mabumunda kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Numpwaji sakaka, Musa ngasejumpeki mwanganya libumunda lelihuma kunani kwaka Sapanga. Lakini Atati bangu bumpeke libumunda la sakaka kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Ndaba libumunda laka Sapanga lelaapeke bandu womi ndi jojuhuluka kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga na jojaapeke bandu bupunndema womi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Ndipala jaapwagila, “Bambo, utupekia libumunda heli masoba goha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nepani ndi posu jejapeke bandu womi. Jojuhika kwangu nepani ngajijoi inzala, najojunhobale ne kyee ngajijoi nywita. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Lakini ngati enumpwagi mmweni nepani lakini ngamwihobalele. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Boka baambeke Atati biihika kwango, nane nganundeke kunza mundu jokapi jojuhika kwango. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Ngase na hulwiki kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga kuhenga ganagapai namwete ila hulwiki ili kuhenga gala gajugapai jojundumiki. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Jola jojundumiki jupala haga, naunhoa hata jumu kati ja bandu ba jumbeki ila nanhyoha boka lisoba la mwiso. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Ndaba gabagapai Atati bango ndi ganga, kila joandingali Mwana nukuhobale jombi jubiya na womi wa masoba goha. Nane nanhyoha lisoba la mwiso.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Ndipala Ayaudi batumbuliya kumumuta ndaba Yesu japwajiki, “Jombi ndi libumunda lelahuluka kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Bombi bapwaga, “Jonzo lee nga Yesu mwana waka Josepu? Twetwaamanyiki atati baki na amabaki? Henu jupwaga boo juhulwiki kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nkotuka kumumutanila kati jinu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Ngamundu jojuwesa kuhika kwangu nepani, sanga kuhutwa na Atati bandumiki, nane nayoha lisoba la mwiso. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Alota baka Sapanga ahandiki ana, ‘Bandu boka biboliwa na Sapanga.’ Kila mundu joajone Atati nukulibola mabolee kuhuma kwaki juhika kwango. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Nga mundu jojabweni Atati, ila jombi jojuhuma kwaka Sapanga hoju ndi jojabweni Atati. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Numpwaji sakaka, mundu jokapi jojuhobalee jiipata womi wa masoba goha. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Nepani ndi posu sekileta womi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Aka hoku binu bakula kilebi sebikikema mana pulukoba, hata hela bawii. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Lakini senze kilebi sekihuluka kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga kila mundu jokapi jojukula nga jwiikuwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Nepani ndi libumunda lelileta womi gogwahuluka kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga. Mundu najukuliki libumunda lende jwitama masoba goha. Na libumunda lenumpeke nepani ndi nhyega jango, gonipia ndaba ja womu wa bandu bapandema pani.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Ndipala Ayaudi patumbuliya kulosana beni na beni ngamaa kati jabu bakapwaga, “Juwesa boo mundu jonzo kutupeke twe nhyega jaki ili twe tukulaje?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Sakaka numpwaji, nangakula nhyega jaka Mwana waka Mundu na kunywa mwai waki ngamwikubi na womi nkati jino. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Mundu jokapi jojukula nhyega jangu na kunywa mwai wango jupata womi wa masoba goha, nane nayoha lisoba la mwiso. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ndaba nhyega jangu ndi posu ja sakaka, na mwai wa nikinywaji sa sakaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Mundu jokapi jojukula nhyega jaa na kunywa mmwai waa jutama nkati jango nane ndama nkati jaki. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Atati baabi bomi andumiki nenga, nanepani ndama na mwomi, ahelahe jojungula nepani jiendaliya kutama na womi. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Lende ndi libumunda lelahuluka kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga, nga ngati mana yebakula aka hoku binu nakuwa. Ila jojikula libumunda lende juitama masoba goha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesu japwaga malobi ganga pajabii jakabola mu nyumba jukuketangena Ayaudi ku Kapelinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malobi gagaleta womi wa masoba goha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Banafunzi baki bingi pabajowana malobi haga bapwaaga, “Mabole ganga ganonwipi. Nyajojuwesa kugajetakela?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesu jamanyiki banafunzi baki ayoma kuhusu mabolee gala, ndipala jaalalukiya, “Boo lijambu lende liwesa lee kuhoa kuhobalela? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Kuibiya boo henu pamumbona Mwana waka Mundu jakakwela kujenda kojabii kabula? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Loho ndi jejileta womi, makili gaka mundu ngase gawesa sindo. Malobi ganga ganumpwagi mwanganya ndi loho na womi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Lakini abi bangi kati jinu banga kuhobalela.” Ndaba Yesu jamanyiki toka puwanzu nya ngasejuhobale na jola joang'alumbuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Yesu japwaga, “Ndaba numpwaji nga mundu jojuwesa kuhika kwangu nepani ila mbaka Atati anhwesisa kuhika kwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Ndipala ndaba ja malobi haga banafunzi baki bingi bundeka Yesu na ngase baendaliya kumpwata kabee. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Ndipala Yesu jaapwagila banafunzi komi na abeli bala, “Boo! Na mwanganya mpala kuboka ahelahela?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simoni Petili japwaga, “Bambo, tujenda kwaka nyanye? Weapa gubi na malobi ga womi wa masoba goha. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Natwe tuguhobale weapa ndi mundu wa Sapi kuhuma kwaka Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nepani kajika nenunhwagwi mwanganya komi na abeli? Lakini jumu wii ndi Lijobi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Japwaaga hela ndaba jaka Yuda mwana waka Simoni Isikalioti, ndaba hoju jabiya ndi joang'alumbuka, lakini jabi nkati ja banafunzi baki komi na abeli.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na alongu baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Pagajomukiya ganiaga, Yesu jabia jakajendajenda mu Galilaya, ndaba ngasejapai kujenda ku Yudea ndaba aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi bapala kunkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Lisoba la tipati ga Ayaudi lukutama mwi indamba labia liegali, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>alongu baka Yesu bumpwajila, “Guboka pamba gujenda ku Yudea, ili banafunzi baku akagabona mahengu gaguhenga. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Nga mundu jojuhiya majambu gajuhenga anajupala jumanyikana kwa bandu. Ndaba guhenga majambu ge haga nala ulilangia kwa bandu bupundema poti!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Hata akalongu baki ngasebunhobalile.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesu jaapwajila, “Kipindi sangu sekibii sapi ngasekihikike, lakini kwinu mwanganya ipindi yoti ya sapi. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Bandu bupundema ngaawesi kunsuki mwanganya, ila anzuki nepani, ndaba nepani naapwagi mahengu gabu giliya. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Mwanganya nnzendaniya ku tipati. Nepani nganyendi ku tipati, ndaba kipindi sangu saasapi sakona ngasekihikike.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Yesu pajajomula kwaapwagi ganiaga, jahigaliya ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jubii ku tipati gu kutama mwindamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Alongu baki pababiya apiti ku tipati, Yesu najombi jajenda ahelahe, lakini jajenda sukulihiya bila kulilangi kwa bandu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi babiya bukuntaputa mtipati, balalukiya, “Jubi kwako?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Babiya atenda kubolane. Bangi bapwaaga, “Yesu mundu jwa amboni” Bangi bapwaaga, “Ngahela, ila jaakonga bandu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Lakini ngamundu jojalenga kundongale pagwendu, ndaba jakaajogopa aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Hata hela tipati egahika pikilanda, Yesu jajingala mu Nyumba jaka Sapanga nuku tumbuli kubola bandu. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi basangi bapwaaga, “Boo mundu ajo mabole haga jupatiki kwako najombi ngase bumbolike?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Mabolee ga mola nga gango, ila gaka jola jojundumiki. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Mundu najupai kuhenga gajupala Sapanga, jiimanya ana mabole gangu gahuma kwaka Sapanga, au gahuma kwangu namwete. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Mundu jojupwa malobi gaki mweni pe jutaputa ulumbi waki mweni, ila jojutaputa ulumbi waka joantumiki, hoju julonge sakaka wala nkati jaki ngasejubii nu ubaja wokapi. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Musa ngasejumpeki mwanganya Malagalaki? Lakini ngajumuwi jojukamulaki malagalaki jene. Boo, henu ndaba jakii mpala kungoma nenga?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Bandu bala bapwaaga, “Wehapa gubii ni kilombu. Nya jojupala kugukoma weapa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesu japwaaga, “Nahengiki ndonduke jimu mwanganya ntenda kusangaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Musa jumpekia Malagalaki gu kuseku jandu. Lakini Malagalaki gee haga ngasegahuma kwaka Musa ila kwaka aka ahoku bitu na mwanganya nseku jandu hata Lisoba lu Kupomulela. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Ana mundu juwesa kunseku jandu mundu Lisoba lu Kupomulela ili Malagalaki gaka Musa giihalabika, boo ndaba ja kii nhyome nepani kundamisa mundu Lisoba lu Kupomulela? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Nkotuka kutemu kukulingali kunza pee, ila ntemula ngati ejupala Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Kilisitu nkombose joantumiki Sapanga?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Henu, bandu bangi buku Yelusalemu bapwaaga, “Jonoju lee ngajobuntaputa ili bunkomaje? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Linga! Ajo hapa julonge pagwendu, wala nga mundu joampwagi lilobi! Henu aka kilongosi amanyiki jonzo ndi Kilisitu nkombosi? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Kilisitu pajihika nga mundu jojwimanya kojuhumila, lakini twepani tukumanyi kojuhumi mundu ajo.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Henu Yesu pajwabiya jubola mu Nyumba jaka Sapanga, japwaga kwa sauti, “Ati mpwaga nepani mmanyi nakonhuma mukumanyi? Lakini nepani ngasenhikiki kupete uwesu wangu na mwete, ila jojundumiki ndi jwa sakaka. Mbanganya ngasemumanye, <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>nepani nummanyiki ndaba nahuma kwaki najombi ndi jojundumiki.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Ndienu bataputa kunkamu, lakini nga mundu jojalenga kunkamu ndaba saa jaki jabiya jakona ngasejihikike. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Bandu bingi munsambi we gola batenda kunhobale bapwaaga, “Boo Kilisitu pajiihika jihenga nginyuli ngolongu ngani kupeta yejahenga ajojo?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alonda baatuma kunkamu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Afalisayu bajowana bandu bakabolannya malobi gaka Yesu gala, ndi bombi pamu na agolu akolongu baatuma alonda babu ajenda bukunkamula. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesu japwaaga, “Nepani nakona pamu numbanganya kukipindi kijipi ndienu nikelubuka kwaka jojundumiki. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Mwindaputa wala ngamwimone, ndaba ngamwiwesi kuhika pandu panibiya.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Alongosi ba Ayaudi balongalaniya beni na beni, “Mundu jonzo jijenda kwako twepani sangakuwesa kumbona? Boo jijenda ku misi ja Agiliki koahami Ayaudi na kwaabola Agiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Jubii na maana boo ejupwaaga, ‘Mwindaputa lakini ngamwimoni na panibiya mwanganya ngamwiwesi kuhika?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Losi ya masi ga womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Lisoba la mwisu la tipati gi indamba labiya lisoba likolongu. Yesu jajema nukupwaga kwa sauti ngolongu, “Mundu najubi na nywita, juhika kwangu jukunywa. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Ngati Maandiku ga Sapi egapwaga, ‘Jojunhobale nepani, losi ya masi ga womi ginyika kuhuma nkati jaki.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Yesu japwaaga haga kundongule Loho jaka Sapanga, bandu bala ba bunhobali jombi bitenda kunzopa. Kipindi se hesi Loho jaka Sapanga jabii ngasejihikike, ndaba Yesu jabiya jakoni ngasejujingi muukolongu waki.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubaganika kwa bando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Ndipala nsambi wa bandu be bala pabajowana malobi gala bapwaaga, “Sakaka mundu jonzo ndi Mlota jwaka Sapanga jola.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Bangi bapwaga, “Jonzo ndi Kilisitu nkombosi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Bangi bapwaga, “Kilisitu lee juwesa kuhuma ku Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Maandiku ga Sapi lee ngasegapwajiki Kilisitu jisaliwa mukibeleku saka Nkolongu Daudi na musi uku Betelehemu, musi gola gojatama Daudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Ndipala bandu batenda kubaganika ndaba jaka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Bangi kati jabu bapala kunkamu, lakini nga mundu jojalenga kungusa.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akolongu ba Ayaudi ngase ahobale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Ndienu alonda bala bakelubuka kwa akolongu ba agolu na Afalisayu. Nabombi balalukiya alonda, “Boo, ndaba ja kii ngasemundetiki Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Alonda bala bapwaga, “Ngasejubii mundu jojuwesa kulonge ngati ejulonge mundu jola!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Afalisayu bapwaga, “Boo na mwanganya ahelahe jutei kunkonga? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Boo nhwahiki lee kumbona kilongosi jokapi ja bandu au jumu jwa Afalisayu babunhobalela? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Ngahela lakini nsambi wa bandu aba bangakumanya Malagalaki gaka Musa, apatiki yaambamba kuhuma kwaka Sapanga!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Mfalisayu jumu jobunkema Nikodemu jojawahiki kunzende Yesu jaapwagila, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Kulengana na malagalaki gitu ngasetuwesa kuntemu mundu kabula jukunzone nukumanya gajuhenga.”<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Nabombi bajibua, “Nawehapa lee ahelahela guhumi ku Galilaya? Henu ukasoma wamweti Maandiku ga Sapi na we wibona ngasejubii mlota waka Sapanga jojuhumi ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Kila mundu jabuja ku nyumba jaki.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Mmbomba ankamu jutenda ugone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Ndienu Yesu jajenda ku kitombi si Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Kilabu jaki pulukela jakelubukiya kabee mu Nyumba jaka Sapanga. Bandu boka bunhikila nukutama nabu, jabiya jakaabola. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Abola ba Malagalaki pamu na Afalisayu bundeta mbomba jumu joankamwi ugoni bunzemika palongi ja bandu boka. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Bumpwajila Yesu, “Mbola, Mbomba jonzo tukamwi jakatenda ugoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Kulengana na Malagalaki gaka Musa galagalaki kalapu malibu mbaka kua aka mbomba ngati haba, henu we gupwaga bolee?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Bapwaaga hela ili kundenga Yesu ili apata ndaba jukuntaki. Lakini Yesu jajinama nukuandika pai nu lukonzi lwaki. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Nabombi pabaendaliya kundaluki Yesu jajumuka nakapwaaji, “Mundu jokapi kati jinu jwanga na mahakau jujumuka jutumbuliya kundapu malibu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Ndipala jajinama kabee nu kuandika panani juluhombi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Pabajowana malobi gala, jaboka jumujumu balonguliya aseja. Yesu jahigaliya kajika jaki, nu mbomba jola jabiya jakona jujemiki apalapa. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Yesu pajajumuka ngaseambweni mundu ila mbomba jola, andalukiya, “Mbomba, bandu ba bukukamwi bala abii kwako? Boo ngamundu jo jukutemwi gubi na makosa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Mbomba jola japwaaga, “Bambo, ngasejubi mundo hata jumu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Ndipala Yesu ampwagila, “Nane ahelahe nganugutemule. Jenda ila witenda mahakau kabee.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi unang'anu gu pundema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yesu jalongila kabee na Afalisayu, “Nepani ndi unang'anu wa bandu bupundema. Jokapi jojumbwata kyee ngajiijendi nndwii, ila jibiya na unang'anu wa womi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Ndipala Afalisayu bumpwajila, “Weapa ulilongale wamweti, malobi gaku ga gupwaga haga nga ga sakaka.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Hata nanililongali namweti, malobi gangu ga sakaka, ndaba manyiki kohumiki na konyenda. Lakini mwanganya ngasemmanyiki kohumiki wala konyenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Mwanganya ntemu ngati bandu eatemu, lakini nepani ngasenuntemwi mundu jokapi. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Hata nandenda kutemu, kutemu jangu ja sakaka, ndaba ngase mii kajika jangu lakini Atati baandumiki abi pamu nane. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Ahandiki mu Malagalaki ginu ana bandu abeli alongi lijambu limu ajetangane kuhusu sindu sebikibweni ndi malobi ge aga gibia gasakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Nepani nililongale sakaka namwete na Atati baandumiki anongalee sakaka kuhusu nepani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Ndienu bundalukiya, “Atati baku abi kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu japwaaga, “Nepani ngasemmanyiki wala Atati bangu ngasemwamanyiki, emwakamanyi nepani, mwakabiya mwaamanyiki na Atati bango.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesu jalongila malobi ge haga pajabiya jubola mu Nyumba jaka Sapanga nsumba sukubeke matambiku, wala nga mundu joankamula, ndaba muda waki wabi wakona ngaseguhikike.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Konyenda mwanganya ngakuwesa kujenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yesu jaapwagila kabee, “Nepani ndenda kuboka, mwanganya mwindenda kundaputa, lakini mwikua kwa mahakau gino. Nepani konijenda mwanganya ngamwiwesi kuhika.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi balaluana, “Boo jupala lee kujenda kulikoma? Mbona jupwaaga konyenda ne mwanganya ngamwiwesi kuhika?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Mbanganya nhuma pai pani, lakini nepani nhumiki kunani. Mwanganya mwabandu bupundema pani lakini nepani nga namundu jupundema pane. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Ndi ndaba nabii numpwaji mwikuwa kwa mahakau gino ana ngasenhobale, ‘Nepani ndi Jojuwe.’ Mwikuwa kwa mahakau gino.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Ndipala bundalukiya, “Boo weapa ndi wanyanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu japwaaga, “Nepani ndi jola jonumpwagila toka panatumbuliya kulonge. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Mii na malobi gingi gukumpwagi nu kuntemu mwanganya. Lakini jojundumiki ndi jwa sakaka, nane numpwaagi mwabandu bupundema malobi ganyowini kuhuma kwaki.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Ngasebamanyiki ngati japwaaga kuhusu Sapanga Atati baki. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Ndipala Yesu jaapwagila, “Pamwantondabia Mwana waka Mundu kunani, hapa ndi pamwimanya, ‘Nepani ndi Jojuwe.’ Na ngasehennga sokapi namwete, ila mbwaga pe gabamoliki Atati. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Jombi jojanduma jubi pamu nane, ngasejanei kajika jango, ndaba henga masoba goha ga gundenganile.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Yesu pajajomulaa kupwaga malobi ge haga bandu bingi batenda kunhobale.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usakaka witenda kundekake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Ndipala Yesu jaapwagila Ayaudi bala babahobali, “Mwanganya nanzetaki malobi gango mwibiya mwa banafunzi bangu basakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Mwajimanya sakaka na sakaka heji jitenda kundekakela.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Bumpwagila, “Twepani kibeleku saka Ibulahimu, Wala ngasetubii twaatumwa kwaka mundu jokapi. Ndaba jaki gupwaga, ‘Sakaka jiitenda kutulekakela?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Numpwaji sakaka, kila jojuhenga mahakau jwibiya jutumaki mahakau. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Ntumwa ngasejutama pa nyumba masoba goha, lakini mwana jutama masoba goha. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Ndienu Mwana najundekaki, mwilekakiwi sakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Manyiki mwanganya ndi kibeleku saka Ibulahimu lakini ntaputa kungoma ndaba nkana kujetake mabole gango. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Nepani mbwaga gala ganagabweni kwa Atati bango, lakini mwanganya uhenga ganzowini kuhuma kwa atati bino.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Bapwaga, “Twepani atati bitu a Ibulahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu jaapwagila, “Ana mmbanganya emwakabii mwabana baka Ibulahimu, mwakahenga ngati ejwabiya juhenga Ibulahimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Nepani numpwagi sakaka jenyoini kuhuma kwaka Sapanga, hata hela mwanganya mpala kungoma. Ibulahimu ngasejatei hela! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Mwanganya uhenga mahengu gahenga atati binu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Bapwaga, “Twepani nga twabana ba panyumba. Tubii na atati bamu ndi Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Sapanga ebakabi Atati binu, mwakambala nepani, ndaba humiki kwaka Sapanga na henu mi pamba. Wala ngasenahika kupete uwesu wangu namweti lakini jombi jojundumiki. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Ndaba ja kii ngaseuhobale malobi ga numpwagila? Ndaba ngasempala kujowane malobi gango. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Mmbanganya atati binu Lijobi na mwanganya mpala kuhenga gapai atati binu. Jombi jabii jojukoma toka puwanzu. Najombi ngasejutama puusakaka, ndaba ngasejibi sakaka nkati jaki. Kila ejupwaga isoli, jupwaga gaki mweni, ndaba jombi jwinisoli na atati baki bini isoli. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Ndaba nepani numpwagi sakaka mwanganya ngaseuhobale nepani. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Boo nya kati jinu jojuwesa kulangi nepani mi na mahakao? Ana nepani mbwaga ga sakaka, ndaba jakii mwanganya ngasenhobalela? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Jojukuba mundu jwaka Sapanga jujoana malobi gaka Sapanga. Lakini mwanganya ngasenzowane ndaba nga mwabandu baka Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jabii kabula jaka Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Ayaudi bumpwaga Yesu, “Boo ngase twapwajiki sakaka weapa gu Msamalia kabee gubi ni ilomboo?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nepani naajowane Atati bangu.” Lakini mwanganya ngasenyoane nepani. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Wala nepani ngasendaputa ukolongu wango. Ila jubi jumu jojundaputi ukolongu wangu najombi ndi jojutemu. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Numpwaji sakaka, “Mundu najukamwi malobi gangu nga giikui ila giitama masoba goha.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Henu Ayaudi bumpwagila, “Henu tumanyiki gubi niilombu! Ibulahimu jawii, na alota bawii nawe gupwaga mundu najilikamwi lilobi laku ngajikui yaka petapeta. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Boo gulibona lee weapa gu nkolongu kupeta atati bitu Ibulahimu? Jombi jawii na alota bawii. Boo weapa gulibona wa nyanye?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesu japwaga, “Nanililumbali na mwete ukolongu waa nga sindo, Atati bangu ndi ba anumbali nepani ba mwakema mwanganya ndi Sapanga wino. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Mwanganya ngasemumanyiki lakini nepani numanyiki. Ana mbwagiki ngasenumanyiki nibiya nonge isoli ngati mwanganya, lakini nepani numanyiki kabee nilijetake lilobi laki. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Atati binu Ibulahimu batoguli ngamaa ndaba bapala kulibona lisoba langu lukuhika najombi jilibweni nukutogule.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Ayaudi bumpwajila, “Weapa ngaseguhiki yaka amusini, enu gupwaga boo gumbweni Ibulahimu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nupwagi sakaka, kabula Ibulahimu ngasejubelikwi, ‘Nena bii.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Apalapa batondula malibu ili bundapula, lakini Yesu jilihia nukupita pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamisa mundu jwanga kulinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesu pajabiya jupeta mwindela, ambona mundu jumu jojabii ngasejulinga toka kubelekwa kwaki. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Banafunzi baki bundalukiya, “Mbola, nya jojuhengiki mahakau mundu ajo au ahengo na amabu baki mbaka jubelikwi jwanga kulinga?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesu japwaga, “Jonzo ngasejatei mahakau wala ahengo na amabu baki. Jwasaliwi jwangalinga ili makili gaka Sapanga gabonikana gakahengika mumaisa gaki. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Kipindi sakona lioba mutu tupalika kuhenga lihengu laka jola jojundumiki. Ndaba ikilu jiegali na nga mundu jojuwesa kuhenga lihengu laka jola jojundumiki. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Kipindi semi pundema nepani ndi unang'anu gupundema.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Pajajomula kupwaga haga, Yesu jahuna imata pai, jalenganakiya likandu, ampakia jwanga linga jola likandu mmiho. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Ampwajila, “Gujenga ukasamba masi ku kiliba sa Soloamu.” Maana jilihina lende ndi “Joantumiki.” Ndienu jajenda nukusamba, jakelubuka koni jakalinga.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Bandu bapambipi jaki na babumbona kipindi sumunyuma jakabiya julobaloba, bapwaga, “Jonzo le nga mundu jojabii jutama pai nukulobaloba jola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Bangi bapwaaga, “Jombe” Lakini bangi bapwaaga, “Ngaela, nga jombe jutei kulengana naku pena.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Lakini mweni japwaga, “Anenganenga nongubika ndenda kulobaloba.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Ndienu bundalukiya, “Guwesiki boo, sajenu kulinga?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Najombi japwaga, “Mundu jola joankema Yesu jalenganakiya likandu, nukumbaki mmihu nukumbwagi gujenda kukiliba suku Soloamu ukasamba kumihu. Ndienu najenda kusamba, nukuwesa kulinga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Nabombi bundalukiya kabee, “Jubi kwaa mundu we hojo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Japwaaga, “Nepani ngase nukumanye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Afalisayu bundaluki mundu jojulamiswi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Ndipala bumpelika jwangalinga we jola kwaka Afalisayu koni juwesa kulinga henu. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Lisoba Yesu pajahenga likandu nukuyeku mihu jwangalinga jola lakabi Lisoba lu Kupomulela. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Ndipala Afalisayu bundalukiya, “Guwesiki bo kulinga?” Najombi jaapwajila, “Jambakia likandu mmihu, nane nasamba masi kumihu, henu sajenu ndenda kulinga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Afalisayu baakumwa bapwaga, “Mundu jonzo ngasejuhumiki kwaka Sapanga ndaba ngasejukamu Malagalaki ji Lisoba lu Kupomulela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Afalisayu bangi bapwaga, “Juwesa boo mundu jwana mahakau kuhenga nginyuli ngati heje?” Batenda kubaganika kati jabu. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Ndienu Afalisayu bundalukiya kabee jojabi ngakulinga, “Boo wamwee gupwaga bole kuhusu mundu jola jojugukulamisa miho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Japwaga, “Jombi ndi Mlota Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Lakini alongosi ba Ayaudi ngasebahobalile ana mundu jola ngasejawesa kulinga, nasajenu juwesa kulinga, mbaka pabaakema ahengo na amabu baki, <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>nakalaluki, “Jonzo ndi mwana wino jojabelikwi bila kuwesa kulinga? Henu sajenu juwesiki boo kulinga?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Ahengo na amabu baki bajibua, “Tumanyiki jonzo mwana witu, na jabelikwi bila kulinga. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Lakini ngasetumanyiki sekipiti mbaka kulinga sajeno, wala ngasetumanyiki nyaa joanhyeku mihu gaki. Mundalukiya mwene ndaba jombi mundu mwanahota juwesa kulandi mwene!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Ahengo na amabu baki bapwaga hela ndaba jakaajogopa akikilongosi ba Ayaudi, ndaba Ayaudi babiya ajetangani mundu jokapi jojipwaga Yesu ndi Kilisitu Nkombosi bambenga mu Nyumba jukuketangane Ayaudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Ndaba ahengo na amabu baki bapwaga, “Jombi mundu mwanahota mundalukiya mwene!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Ndienu bunkema kabee jojabi jusaliwi bila kulinga jola nukumpwagi, “Pwaga sakaka na Sapanga jugujoannya! Twepani tumanyiki mundu hoju jubii na mahakau.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Jombi jaapwagila, “Ana jombi jubii na mahakau ne ngasemanyike. Natu semanyiki nabii ngakuwesa kulinga na sajenu ndenda kulinga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Bundalukiya, “Jombi juguhengi kike? Juguyekula boo, mihu gako?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Najombi jaapwagila, “Nenumpwaji wala ngasenzoa. Ndaba ja kii mpala nupwajila kabee? Boo, namwanganya kabee mpala kuba mwa banafunzi bake?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Ndipala buntondula nukupwagi, “Weapa ndi mbolee waka mundu jola, twepani ndi twa banafunzi baka Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Tumanyii Sapanga jalongila na Musa, lakini ngasetumanyiki kojuhumi mundu hoju!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Najombi jaapwagila, “Haleli lijambu lukusangasa! Mwanganya ngasemmanyiiki kojuhuma, lakini jombi juyekwi mihu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Tumanyiki Sapanga ngaseanzoane jwana mahakau, ila anzowane mundu jola joanzogopa nukuhenga gajupala. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Tumbuka kubomba nndema ngasetujowini mundu jugayekwi mihu gaka mundu jojubelikwi bila kulinga. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Ana mundu hoju ngasejahumiki kwaka Sapanga, ngajakawesiki kuhenga lihengu ngati alele.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Japwaga, “Wehapa wasaliwa nukukole mumahakau, uwesa boo, kutubola twepane?” Ndi bumbengila kunza ja Nyumba jukuketangane Ayaudi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusindwa kulinga ki Loho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesu jajowana ampihiki kunza mu Nyumba jukuketangane Ayaudi, ehambona kabee ampwagila, “Boo, weapa lee guhobale Mwana waka Mundu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Mundu jola japwaga, “Bambo, gumbwajila Mwana waka Mundu we hoju ndi nyanye, ili wesa kunhobalela.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Umbwene, jombi ndi jojulonge naweapa sajeno.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Ndipala mundu jola japwaaga, “Bambo, nuguhobalela.” Najombi anzinamiya Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesu japwaga, “Nepani hikiki pundema kaabaganisa bandu, ili bandu bangalinga alinga, na bandu balinga biilinga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Afalisayu bangi babakabi pamu najombi pabajowana haga, bumpwajila, “Boo, natwe lee ngasetulinga?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Ana mwakabii ngasenndinga ngamwakabii na mahakau, lakini henu mwanganya mpwaaga, twe tutenda kulinga, hempwaga hela nndangi mwakona mbii na mahakao.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Malenganu guku nndimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesu japwaga, “Numpwagi sakaka, mundu jokapi jwanga kujingi mukisisi sa makondoo sukukupetee punndyangu, lakini jujingi kupete pandu pangi, hoju mwie kabee hoju linzolinzoli. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Lakini mundu jojujingi kupete punndyangu, hoju ndi nndimi wa makondoo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Nndonda wikisisi jutenda kunhogule, na makondoo gajowana lilobi laki, najombi jwagakema makondoo gaki kila limu ku liina laki, na kugalongulake kunza. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Pajujomo kugapia kunza, jagalongule kulongi nagombi makondoo gatenda kumpwata, ndaba gijimanya malobi jaki. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Makondoo haga ngase gawesa kumpwata nngeni, ila gatenda kuntila ndaba ngasebilimanya malobi gaki.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesu jwaapwagila lilenganu heli, lakini bombi ngase bamanyiki sejwapala kwaapwagi.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi nndimi jwa amboni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Ndienu Yesu jwapwaga kabee, “Numpwagi sakaka, nepani nundyangu wa makondoo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Bangi boka babanonguli nepani babi bii na manzolinzoli, na makondoo ngasegaajogwani boombe. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Nepani nunndyangu. Jojujingi kupete kwangu nepani jwitenda kuokolewa, jwijingila nukupita, nukupata malele. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Mwii juika pee ili kujiba nukukoma nukuhalabana. Nepani nhikiki ili bandu apata womi, womi wa sakaka wanga kupongo.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“Neepani nu nndimi waamboni. Nndimi waamboni juuboa womi waki ndaba ja makondoo gaki. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Lakini mundu jojuhenga kibalua hoju nga nndime, na makondoo nga gake. Pajukibona kimei kitenda kuhika jugaleka makondoo nukutila. Kimei kitukali makondoo nukugabaganisa ndela. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Mundu hoju jutila ndaba ngase jugaangajaki makondoo ndaba jombi mundu jukibalua pena. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Nepani nundimi waamboni. Nagamanyi makondoo gangu, nagombi makondoo gangu gamanyi nepani, <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>ngati Atati heamanya nepani, ndi nanepani henaamanya Atati. Nepani mbia womi wangu ndaba ja makondoo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Kabee mina makondoo gangi ngasegabi mukisisi seno. Ndakiwa kugaleta na haga kabee, nabombi biijogwana malobi gango na kwibia nsambi gumu nu nndimi jumu.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>“Atati ambala nepani ndaba mitayali kupia womi wangu ili nuujopa kabee. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Nga mundu jojuwesa kunyaga womi wangu, nepani mbia sukupala namwete. Mii nuuwesu ukuuboa nukuujuku kabee. Hela ndi Atati eambwagi kutenda.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Yesu pajajomula kupwaga haga Ayaudi babaganika kabee. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Bingi kati jabu bapwaga, “Ajo jubi niilombu, kabee jonojuwe mwanamangongu! Munzogwane wakyane?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Lakini bangi bapwaga, “Haga nga malobi gaka mundu jwiniilombo. Boo kilombu lee kiwesa kuyeku mihu ga bandu banga kulinga?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayaudi bunkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Ku Yelusalemu kwabi tipati gukukomboka kujibeka palongi jaka Bambu Nyumba jaka Sapanga. Kipindi se hesi wabiya nsimu ukipepu. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesu jwabia jwakajendajenda pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga nkati ja sengu jaka Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Henu, Ayaudi bunhyongolota nukundaluki, “Watubeka mukiholu mbaka lile? Ana weapa ndi Kilisitu Nkombosi utupwagila pe hotuhotu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesu jwaapwagila, “Nenumpwagi, lakini ngasenhobalela. Lihengu lenienga kupete uwesu wa Atati bangu lilangi nepani ndi jojuwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Lakini mwanganya ngasenhobale, ndaba mwanganya nga makondoo gango. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Makondoo gangu gajogwana lilobi lango. Nenamwe nagamanyi, nagombi gandenda kumbwata. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Nepani nagapeke womi wa yaka petapeta, nabombi ngabikuwi masoba goha. Wala nga mundu jojuwesa kwagaboa mumaboku gangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Atati bangu baambeki makondoo haga ndi nkolongu kupeta boka, wala nga mundu jojuwesa kwagaboa mumaboku ga Atati. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Nepani na Atati tubi sindu simu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Ndipala, Ayaudi bajukua malibu ili bundapula Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesu jwaapwagila, “Nunndangi mahengu gingi gaasapi kuhuma kwa Atati. Lihengu boo lamboni kati ja mahengu haga gampala kungome kwa maliboo?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Ayaudi bapwaaga, “Ngasetugukoma malibu ndaba jilihengu la amboni, ila ndaba untondwi Sapanga! Wee ulihenga wamwe kuba wa Sapanga koni weapa wa mundu pee.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesu japwaaga, “Boo, ahandiki mu Malagalaki gii, ‘Nee mbwagiki mwanganya mwaka sapanga.’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Sapanga jwaakema aka sapanga bandu bajwaapeki malobi gaki, natwe tumanya Maandiku gaa Sapi galonge sakaka masoba goti. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Henu Atati anhagwi nee nukunduma nepani punndema. Ndaba jakii mwanganya mpwaga nuntondo Sapanga, pa mbwaga, nepani na mwana waka Sapanga? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Ana ngasendenda mahengu ga Atati bangu mwinhobalela. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Ana nihenga mahengu ga Atati bangu, hata na ngase nhobalela, nala unhobaliya mahengu haga. Ili mmanya sakaka Atati abii nkati jangu, nane mi nkati jaki.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Balenga kabee kunkamu Yesu, lakini jwalemangana mumaboku gabu.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Yesu jwajenda kabee kwii ja losi luku Yoludani, pandu pajwabia jwakabatisa Yohana, jwatama koku. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Bandu bingi bunzendila Yesu nukupwaga, “Yohana ngasejwatei nginyuli jokapi. Lakini goka gajwabia jwakapwaga Yohana kunndongale jombi gabia gasakaka nganii.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Bandu bingi pandu pala batenda kuhobalela Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kua kwaka Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Mundu jumu jobunkema Lazalu, mwenei juku Betania, jwabii nngonzu. Betania sabi kijiji sejutamika Malia nu nndombu waki Maluta. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Malia ndi joampakia Bambu mahuta gaganungi mumagolu gaki nukunhungu na majunzu gaki. Kaka waka Malia joakemika Lazalu ndi jojwabia jutenda kulwala. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Ndienu, Malia na Maluta baatuma malobi kwaka Yesu kupwaga, “Bambo, nkosi waku jutenda kulwala!”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesu pajwajogwa jwapwaga, “Ugonzu hogu nga gukukoma ila guhikiki ndaba guleta ulumbi kwaka Sapanga, julwala ili kupete ugonzu wee hogu Mwana waka Sapanga julumbalika.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesu jwaapai ngamaa Maluta na Malia na kaka wabu Lazalu. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Pajapata malobi gu ugonzu waka Lazalu, Yesu jwaendalia kutama koku kwa masoba gangi mabeli. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Ndi jaapwagila banafunzi baki, “Tujendaniya kabee ku musi uku Yudea!”<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Banafunzi bumpwagila, “Mbola, kipetiki kipindi pe kisokopi toka Ayaudi pabapala kugukoma kwa malibu, gupala kabee kujenda koko kabee?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesu jwaajibwa, “Boo, masaa ga lyoba mutu nga komi na mabeli pee? Mundu hejujenda lyobamutu ngajuwesi kulikobando ndaba jugubona unang'anu upundema goni. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Lakini mundu na jujenda ikilu jutenda kulikobando, ndaba ikilu ngasekukuba nunang'ano.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Yesu pajwajomula kupwaga malobi gala, jwaapwagila, “Nkosi witu Lazalu jutei kugonela, lakini nepani niijenda kunnzumu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Banafunzi baki bumpwagila, “Bambo, ana jutei kugone pee mbaka julame.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Bombi bawasalya jupwagiki jugosi lugonu, lakini Yesu jwabi julongale Lazalu jutei kuwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Ndi, Yesu jwaapwagila hotuhotu, “Lazalu jutei kuwa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>lakini nepani ndenda kutogule, ndaba ngasenabi kola, ili nhwesa kuhobale. Henu tubokaniya kojubi Lazalu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Tomasi jobunkema Mapaa jwaapwagila banafunzi ajaki, “Tubokaniya na twee twakakuwa pamu najombi Yesu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi jojuyoa nakapeke bandu womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesu pajwahika kola jwaketania Lazalu bunsikiki na jutemi pilitenge masoba nsesi. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Kijiji suku Betania sabi pambipi nuku Yelusalemu, ulasu waki wabi kilumita itatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Ayaudi bingi babia ahikiki kwaka maluta na Malia kwaajegwesa mawasu ndaba ja kuwa kwaka kaka wabu.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Maluta pajwajogwana Yesu jutenda kuhika, jwajenda kunzopa kuindela, lakini Malia jwaigali ku nyumba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Maluta ampwagila Yesu, “Bambu, ana wakabia apambani, kaka wangu nee nga jwaka wile! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Lakini nee manyiki hata sajenu sokapi sewanndoba Sapanga, jwitenda kugupeke.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Kaka waku jwitenda kuyoka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Maluta japwaga, “Nee manyiki jiyoka lisoba le heli Sapanga jayoa bandu boa, mulisoba la mwisu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Nepani ndi jojuyoha bandu nakaapeke womi. Jojunhobale nepani hata najuwi, jwitama kabee, <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>na jokapi jojutama nukunhobale, ngajikue. Boo, guhobale lee ganiaga?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Maluta jwapwaga, “Hena Bambo, Nepani nhobale weahapa ndi wa Kilisitu, Mwana waka Sapanga, jojuhika pundema.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jutenda kulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Maluta pajwajomula kupwaga gala, jwajenda kunkeme nndombu waki Malia pulutengu, nukumpwagi, “Mbola jubi apambane, jutenda kugukema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Malia pajwajogwa hela, jwajumuka nyatanyata, nukunzende Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Yesu jwabi jwakona ngase jujingi mukijiji, ila jwabia jwakona apalapala pajwaketangana na Maluta. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Ayaudi bababi panyumba pala pamu na Malia bukuzewesa mawasu, pabumbona jujumuka nukupita kunza nyatanyata, batenda kunpwata. Baambusiya jujenda kulele kulitenge.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Malia pajwahika pandu pajwabi Yesu, na paambona pee anzinamiya nukumpwagi, “Bambu, ana wakabi apambani, nhwasa wangu nga jaka wile!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesu paambona Malia jakalela, na Ayaudi bababi pamu najombi na bombi atenda kulela, gumbina moju nukuhangajika ngamaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Ndienu jaapwagila, “Boo mummbei kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Bumpwagila, “Bambu, guhika gulingaje.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesu jatenda kulela. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Ayaudi bapwaaga, “Lola oti Yesu moampali Lazalu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Bangi bapwaaga, “Ajo joanndamisa jwanga kulinga jola, boo jwasinda lee kupengale Lazalu jwikuha?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anhyoa Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yesu koni gumbiniki mwoju kabee, jwahika kulitenge. Litenge lee labi lipoli, leayekali ni lilibu. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Mmboa lilibu heli!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Maluta, nndombu waka jojuwi we hoju, ampwagila, “Bambu, jutumbuli kununga, jutemi mulitenge masoba nsesi!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesu jwapwaaga, “Boo, ngasenugupwagii na guhobali wagubona ukolongu waka Sapanga?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Ndipala baboa lilibu lela. Yesu jwalingalia kunani kwaka Sapanga, nukupwaga, “Nunsengu mwa Atati ndaba Ntenda kunyogwanela. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Nepani manyiki unyongwane masoba goka. Lakini ndenda hela ndaba ja bandu baabi paamba aba ili awesa kuhobale weapa ndi wogundumiki nepani.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Hejwajomula kupwaga hela, jwakema kwa sauti ngolongu, “Lazaloo! Piita kunza!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Jojuwi jola ndi jwapitaa kunza, koni bunkongiki sanda mukuboku na mukugolu, nukumiu jaki kuyekaliwi. Yesu jwaapwagila, “Mumbopula, munndeka jujenda.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayaudi ajetangane kunkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Ayaudi bingi bababi ahikiki kwaka Malia pababona gajutei Yesu, batenda kunhobale. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Bangi bajenda kwa Afalisayu kapwagi majambu gajutei Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Henu agolu akolongu na Afalisayu batenda kuketangana pamu na bandu bapa Sengu ja Ayaudi, balaluana, “Tutendaa bolee? Mundu hajo jutenda nginyuli ingipi ngamaa.<figure style="fig" alt="A Jewish Priest" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Nngolu jwa Ayaudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Anatundekiki pe bandu boti biitenda kunzetake, na Aka kilongosi buku Loma bihika kualabana Nyumba jaka Sapanga na kwa akoma bandu bitu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Ndipala, jumu wabu jobunkema Kayafa, jojabii Nngolu Nkolongu saka se hesi, jwaapwagila, “Mwanganya ngase mukimanyi sindo! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Boo, ngase mbona mbanga kwinu mundu jumu jawelila bandu bingi, kuliku bandu boka kuwaa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Jombi ngasejwapwaga hela ndaba jukupala kwaki ila ndaba jwabii Nngolu Nkolongu saka se hesi, jwalotila kupwaga Yesu jwitenda kuwa ndaba ja Ayaudi boka, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>kuwa kwaki nga ndaba Ayaudi pena, ila kabee ili juwesa kwaaleta pamu bandu baka Sapanga babaeni ndema yengi.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Henu toka lisoba heli aka kilongosi baka Ayaudi ataputa indela jukunkoma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Ndienu Yesu, ngase jwajenda kabee pangwendo ja Ayaudi, ila jwaboka pala, nukujenda pambipi nu lukoba pambipi na musi gobugukema Efulaimu. Jwatama kola pamu na banafunzi baki.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Lisoba lukutogule la Pasaka ja Ayaudi labia lihegali, na bandu bingi bapiti ku Yelusalemu kulisapisa haga ndi malagalaki gaguhenga mundu kundumbaliya Sapanga kabula ji lisoba heli kuhika. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Ndienu, babiya buntaputa Yesu, nabombi pabaketangini pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga balaluana, “Boo mundu we hoju ngajuhiki ku tipati ja Pasaka?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Agolu akolongu na aka Afalisayu babia alagalaki mundu jokapi na jumanyiki pandu pajubi Yesu jwaapwagila ili bunkamula.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bumpaki mauta gaganungali ku Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matei 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Pagahigali masoba sita kabula jukuhika tipati ja Pasaka, Yesu jwahika ku Betania kojwabia jutama Lazalu joanhyoa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Kokuje buntelakiya posu ja pakamii, na Maluta jwabia jutenda kwaatelake. Lazalu jwabi kati ja bandu bababi pamu na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Malia jwajukua mahuta gaganungi ga bei ngolongu nusu lita galenganaki kunkongu gobugukema nado, nukumpaki Yesu mumagolu nukunhungu kwa majunzu gaki. Nyumba joti jatweli ulumba wa mahuta gaganungi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Henu, ntumi waka Yesu jumu, jobunkema Yuda Isikalioti, joanng'anambuka Yesu, jwapwaga, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Mbanga mahuta gabei ngolongu aga bakalombisa hipati mia tatu ya feza, nakaapeke aka kapuko?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Jwapwaga hela, si japala kwaajangati aka kapuku, ila ndaba jabii mwii. Ndaba jukubika jubeka mpuku ulupija, kila mala jwabia jujiba lupija mumpuku gola.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Mundeka, jagalomba mahuta ge haga ili jagabeka lisoba luku ndaga nepani. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Aka kapuku mwikuba nabu masoba goti, lakini nga mwikubi nanepani masoba gote.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayaudi ajetangakane kunkoma Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Ayaudi bingi bajogwini Yesu jubii ku Betania. Ndi bahika kola nga ndaba jukumbona pee Yesu, ila kabee bapala kumbona Lazalu joanhyoha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Agolu akolongu nabombi bajetanganiya kabee kunkoma Lazalu, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>ndaba jukuyoka kwaka Lazalu, Ayaudi bingi baakana aka kilongosi babu, nukunhobale Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jujingi ku Yelusalemu sukutogule ngani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Kilabu jaki, bandu bingi bababiya ahikiki ku tipati ja Pasaka bajogwana Yesu jubi mwindela kuhika ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Ndienu bajukuwa mambandi gi mikongu gabagakema mitendi, koni bajenda kunzopa Yesu bakajamaliya kwa sauti ngolongu bakapwaga, “Julumbalikaa Sapanga! Jupengalika hajo jojuika kupete liina laka Bambu. Julumbalika Bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesu japata liponda, julikwelalia panani jaki ngati hegapwaga Maandiku ga Sapi.<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Mwijogopa mwa bandu buku Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Lingalya Bambu nkolongu wino jutenda kuhika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">jukwei mwana liponda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Banafunzi baki ngasebaheliwi majambu ge gala, lakini Yesu pajayoka nukupata ukolongu, ndi pabakombuka ganigala gabi gaandikwi kundongale jombi bandu bahenga hela ndaba jaki.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Bandu bababi pamu na Yesu kipindi paankema Lazalu kuhuma mulitenge, nukunhyoha, baalandila bandu majambu gala gagapiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Henu bandu bingi bajenda kunzopa, ndaba boka babi ajogwini jutei nginyuli ye hehi. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Henu, Afalisayu bapwaganiya, “Boo mumbwene? Ngatuwesi kutenda sokape! Lingalia, Bandu boka bupundema batenda kumpwata.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Agiliki bangi apala kumbona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Babii Agiliki bangi kati ja bandu bababia ahikiki ku Yelusalemu kunndumbali Sapanga kipindi sukutogule Pasaka sela. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Bunzendila Pilipi, mwenei juku Betisaida ku Galilaya kola, bumpwagila, “Nkolongoo, twaa tupala kumbona Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Pilipi jwajenda kumpwagi Andilea na boka abeli bajenda kumpwagi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesu jwaapwagila, “Lisaa lihikiki Mwana waka Mundu kumpeke ukolongu! <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Numpwagi sakaka, imbeju jimu ji inganu jiigali pee kuba imbeju jimu ngati ejabii, lakini na jiabwiki pai nakuwa jitenda kumela, nukupapa imbeju hingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Jojupala womi waki punndema pani jwitenda kuguhoa, lakini jwanga kugupala womi waki punndema pani, jwagubeka mbaka pajwipata womi wa masoba goti. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Jojupala kundumaki nepani lasima jumbwata neepani, pokapi pamii nepani ndi nuntumisi wangu pajwiibia. Mundu jokapi jojundumaki neepani Atati bangu biitenda kundenda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu julongale kuwa kwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>“Henu moju wangu gubina ngamaa, henu mbwaga kike? Boo, mbwaga lee, ‘Atati nhokula kipindi senze lakini hikiki ndaba jikipindi senze?’ Lakini ne nhikiki ndaba mbetila kipindi senze. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Atati, ulangia ukolongu waku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ndi sauti jajogwanika kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga, “Nangi ukolongu wangu na nilangia kabee.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Bandu bingi bababiya ajemiki pala bajogwa sauti jela, na bangi bapwaga, “Senesi lee kitobe.” Lakini bangi bapwaga, “Ntumi jukunani kwaka Sapanga jutei kulonge naku!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Lakini Yesu jwaapwagila, “Sauti heji ngasejahikiki ndaba jangu nepani, ila ndaba jinu mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Sajenu ndi muda wa bandu bupunndema goni kutemuliwa, henu lijobi jojuwe nkolongu ja ndema jenu ajenda kumboa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Nepani pabiingwea kunani junndema nanhuta kila mundu kuhika kwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Kupwaaga kwaki hela, kwalangia kuwa kwaki kuibiya boo.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Nsambi wa bandu gola gwapwaga, “Twepani Malagalaki jitu jitupwagi Kilisitu nkombosi jwitama yaka petapeta. Henu uwesa boo kupwaga eti Mwana waka Mundu biitenda kunkwea kunani? Kilisitu wee hoju nyane?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Unang'anu wakona gubi na mwanganya kwa kipindi kijipi. Nzendanya pagubii unang'anu hogu ili lwii lwampata, ndaba jojujenda mu lwii ngasejukumanya kojujenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Henu hembii na unang'anu hogu muguhobalya unang'anu ili mmbia mwabandu bu unang'anu.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Ayaudi akana kuhobale Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu hejwajomula kulonge, jwaboka nukujenda kujoba kutali nunsambi wa bandu gola. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Yesu pamu nukutenda ndonduke yoka yela pa bandu lakini bombi ngase bunhobalile. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Ndi malobi gajwapwaga Isaya jojabii mlota waka Sapanga gatenda kutimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Bambu, nyaa jojugahobali malobi gitu gatwaapwagila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Boo na makili gaka Sapanga gabonikini kwaka nyane?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Ndi, ngasebawesa kuhobale, ndaba Isaya jwapwagiki kabee pandu pangi.<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“Sapanga jwatei abiya bangalinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">jatei kuba ang'ang'a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ili biilinga kwa mihu gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">bielewa kwa malangu gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">wala biing'anambukii nepani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ili nhwesaa kwaalamisa.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isaya jojabii mlota waka Sapanga jwapwaga malobi haga ndaba jugubweni ukolongu waka Yesu, ndi jalandila majambu gaki.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Hata hela, aka kilongosi bingi ba Ayaudi bunhobali Yesu. Lakini ndaba jaaka Afalisayu, ngase bunzetaki palongi ja bandu ndaba jukujogopa kwaatumi mu Manyumba jukuketangane Ayaudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Bapai kulumbaliwa na bandu kuliku kulumbaliwa na Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malobi gaka Yesu ndi gaatemula bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Ndi Yesu jwapwagiki kwa sauti ngolongu, “Mundu jojunhobale nepani, ngase junhobale nepani pee, ila anhobalee kabee najojundumiki nepani. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Mundu jojumona nepani ambona kabee na jojundumiki nepani. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Nepani nunang'anu, nanepani nhikiki pundema ili miya nunang'anu ili boka ba anhobalee nepani biigali kulwii. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Jojugajogwane malobi gangu lakini ngase jugakamu, nepani nga nunhukumo. Ndaba ngasenahika kutemu bandu bupu nndema pani ila kwaaokoa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Jwanga kugakamu malobi gangu jubii juku ntemula. Lilobi lee lenumpwaji ndi lukutemula lisoba la mwiso. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Nepani ngase napwagiki ku uwesu wangu na mwete, ila Atati ba andumiki ndi babambwagila mbwaga kii na nongila kii. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Nepani manyiki miilu jaki jileta womi wama soba goka. Henu, nembwaga pee ga anagalaki Atati kugapwaga.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu jwasambisa banafunzi baki magolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Labi lisoba limu kabula ji Lisoba la Pasaka. Yesu jwamanyiki kipindi sukuboka kwaki punndema kujenda kwa Atati lihikiki. Jwabii jwaapai bandu baki boka baabii punndema pani, jwaapai upali wanga na mwiso!<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yesu na banafunzi baki pababia atemi akula posu ja pakamii. Lijobi labi lunzingi Yuda, mwana waka Simoni Isikalioti nukupeke mawasu gu kunng'anambuka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesu jwamanyiki Atati baki babii ampeki kila sindu muuwesu waki, kabee jwamanyiki juhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga na jwabia jukelabuka kujenda kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Ndi jwaboka pababia akula posu pala, jwahula ingobu jaki jakunza nukubeka pulutengu, jajukua nsalu nukukonga nkungi mukibunu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Ndi jwajegala masi mulikalai, nukutumbuli kwaasambisa banafunzi baki magolu na kugahungu ku nsalu gojabii jukongiki mukibunu. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Henu, paanhikila Simoni Petili, Petili jwapwaga, “Bambu we lee gunzambisa nepani magolo?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesu jwapwaaga, “Sajenu nga gumanyi sendenda, ila wimanya mwenikatai.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Petili jwapwaga, “Bambu, kyee weapa ngagunzambisi nepani magolo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu jwapwaga, “Ana nga nugusambisi magolu gaku ngagukubi gu mbolee wango.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simoni Petili jwapwaga, “Bambo, gunzambisaje, nga magolu pena, ila na maboku gee ni kimutu see.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Mundu jojuogiki jukuba junyambisiki ngase jupalika kusambisa magolu pee. Mwanganya nnyambisiki, lakini nga mwaboa.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yesu ammanyiki joang'anambuka, ndaba jwapwaga, “Mwanganya nnyambisiki, lakini nga mwaboa.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Yesu pajwajomula kwaasambisa magolu jawata kabee ingobu jaki, jwatama kabee kula posu, nakwaapwagi, “Boo, mmanyiki lee ganunhengile?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Mwanganya nngemane nu Mbola na Bambu, mpwaga sakaka, ndaba ndi hemii. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Nepani numbola na Bambu wii, nunsambisi mwanganya magolu, nanamu kubidi nsambisana magolu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Numpeki malenganu ili nanamu ntenda ngati enuntendii mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Numpwagi sakaka, ntumi nga nkolongu ngati ejubii bambu wake, wala mundu jobuntumiki ngankolongu kupete jojutuma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Henu, hemugamanyi haga, Sapanga jiitenda kumpenge ana mugahengi lihengu.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>“Gambwaga haga nga ndaba jinu mwanganya mwabote. Nepani naamanyi boka banaahagwi. Lakini lasima gatimia Maandiku gaa Sapi gagapwaga, ‘Mundu jojukulika posu jangu jung'anambwiki nepani.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Nepani numpwagi majambu hagaa sajenu kabula ngase gapitii, ili hegiipitila nhwesa kuhobale, ‘Nepani ndi Jojuwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Numpwagi sakaka, joanzopa mundu jonuntumiki nepani junyopa nepani, na jojunyopa nepani anzopa jojundumiki nepani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jupwaga majambu gu kung'anumbukwa kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matei 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maluko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesu pajwajomula kupwaga hela, mwoju wa gubina ngamaa, jwapwaga hotuhotu, “Numpwagi sakaka, kati jii jumu jwitenda kung'anambuka!”<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Banafunzi balingalania lakini ngase bummanyiki joandongaliaje. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Mmbolee jumu, jojwabia Yesu ampai ngamaa, jwabia jutemi pambipi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Henu Simoni Petili ankinyulia mbolee jola nukupwagi, “Nndalukia andongale nyane.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Mbolee jola jwahegalia pambipi ngani na Yesu, nukunndaluki, “Bambu, tupwagila gundongale nyane?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Jonampekia kipandi silibumunda sendobi mubakuli, ndi jojoju.” Ndi, jwajukua kipandi silibumunda, nukutobe mu bakuli, nukumpeke Yuda, mwana waka Simoni Isikalioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yuda pajwajopa pee kipandi silibumunda sela, Lijobi latenda kunzingi. Ndi Yesu ampwagila, “Segupala kutenda, tenda nyatanyata!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Lakini ngaa hata jumu kati jabu babatemi pabakula posu pala, jojwabii jumanyi ndaba jukumpwaga hela. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Ndaba Yuda jabiya jutunza mpuku ulupija, bangi bawasalia Yesu ampwagila jujenda kulomba hindu yebiipalika tipati ja Pasaka, au ampwagila jwakapia sokapi kwaka kapuku.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Ndienu, Yuda hejwajukua kipandi silibumunda sela, jwapita kunza. Kipindi se sela sabii ikilu.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilu minyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yuda ejwabiya jubokiki, Yesu jwapwaga, “Henu ukolongu waka Mwana waka Mundu gubonakini, ahelahe ukolongu waka Sapanga gubonakini kupete jombi. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Ana ukolongu waka Sapanga guyekuliwi nkati jaka Mwana waka Mundu, nala Sapanga jilangia ukolongu waka Mwana nkati jaki mweni kabee nga jiselewi kuhenga hela. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Mwabana bangu, nepani nakona mii na mwanganya kwa muda nzipi pee. Mwitenda kundaputa, lakini ganupwaji sajenu nabii naapwagi aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi, ‘Konyenda nepani mwanganya nga nhwesi kujenda!’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Henu nupeke miilu minyae, mpalana. Mpalana ngati nepani henumpai mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Ana mpalini, bandu boka biimanya mwanganya mwa banafunzi bangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu julandi Petili jwitenda kunkana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matei 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simoni Petili andalukia, “Bambu, gujenda kwako?” Yesu jwapwaaga, “Konyenda nepani ngaguwesi kumpwata sajeno, lakini wimbwata mwenikatai.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Petili jwapwaga kabee, “Bambo, ndaba jakii nganhwesi kugupwata sajeno? Nepani mitayali kuwa ndaba jako!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Boo, sakaka lee gubi tayali kuwa ndaba jangu nepane? Nugupwagi sakaka, kabula jukubeka likongobi wiingana mala patatu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu indela jukujenda kwa Atati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesu jwaapwagila, “Mwiola myoju jii. Munhobaliya Sapanga, nhobalia na nepani kabee. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Munyumba ja Atati bangu ibi yumba ingi, ana ngakwakabi hela nakabiya numpwagi. Henu nyenda kunhandali pandu pukutama. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Nepani nambiti kuhandali pandu pukutama, nikelubuka kunzuku nhika kwangu nepani, ili nanamu mwibia paniibia nepani. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Mwanganya mjimanyi indela jukujenda konijenda.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomasi jwalalukiya, “Bambu, ngase tukumanyi kogujenda, twiwesabo kujimanya indela jene?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Nepani ndi indela na sakaka na womi. Nga mundu jojuwesa kujenda kwa Atati ila kupete kwangu nepani. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Ana mwakamanyi nepani, mwakaamanya na Atati bangu. Tangu sajenu mwaamanyi Atati kabee mwaambweni.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Pilipi ampwagila, “Bambu, utulangia Atati ndi setupala.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Ndemi na mwanganya masoba goti haga, wa Pilipi ngase gumanyi nepane? Jojumweni nepani jwaabweni Atati. Henu guwesabo kupwaga, ‘Tulangia Atate?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Boo, ngase uhobale nepani mii nkati ja Atate, na bombi atati abii nkati jango? Malobi ganumpwagi mwanganya ngasegahuma kwango, Ila gahuma kwaka Atati bangu baabi nkati jangu atenda lihengu laki. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Mpalika kunhobale nenga hembwaga nepani mii nkati ja Atati na Atati abii nkati jangu. Ana ngasenhobale nhobalia ndaba ja mahengu ganihenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Numpwagi sakaka, jojunhobale nepani jwitenda mahengu gandenda nepani. Ena, jwitenda makolongu ngani kupeta yenhengiki nee, ndaba nyenda kwa Atati. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Sokapi semwiloba kupete liina langu mbaka ndendi, ili Atati alumbalika kwii indela jaka Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Ana nnobiki sokapi kupete liina langu, mbaka ndendi.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jupwaga antuma Loho jaka Sapanga kwitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“Ana mnipai, mwikamula miilu jangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Nane naaloba Atati na bombi bampeki Jukunzangati jongi, jojwitama na mwanganya yaka petapeta. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Jojuwe ndi Loho jaka Sapanga jojutupwaji sakaka majambu gaka Sapanga. Bandu bupundema ngaseawesa kunzopa ndaba ngase awesa kumbona wala kummanya. Lakini mwanganya mumanyi ndaba juhigii na mwanganya kabee jubi nkati jinu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>“Nganundeki mwanganya kajika jinu ngati mwakeba, nihika kabee kwinu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Guigali muda nsokopi, na bandu bupunndema pani ngaamoni kabee. Lakini mwanganya mbaka mmoni, ndaba nepani mi na womi, na mwanganya mwibia mwa bomi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Lisoba le heli paliika ndi pamwimanya nepani mi nkati ja Atati bangu, na mwanganya mmbi nkati jangu, na nepani nkati jino.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>“Jokapi jojujopa miilu jangu nukuikamu, hoju ndi jojumbala, na jojumbala nepani Atati bangu biitenda kumpala, nane nampala nukulilangi kwaki.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yuda nga nsikalioti jola, andaluki Yesu, “Bambu, boo walilangia kwitu twepani lee badala jukulilangi kwa bandu bupunndema pane?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Mundu na jumbai nepani jalijowaniya lilobi langu, na Atati bangu biitenda kumpala, Atati nane twiika kwaki nukutama nkati jaki. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Jwanga kumbalane ngajujowane malobi gango. Namalobi gannyogwini nepani nga gangu nepani, ila gaa Atati baandumiki.”<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>“Numpwagi malobi haga koni nakona mii pamu na mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Lakini Jukunzangati mwanganya, Loho jaka Sapanga, jo bantuma Atati kupete liina langu, jwammbola kila sindu nuku nkombosa goti ganumpwaagi.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>“Nundeke lukwali, numpeke lukwali lwangu. Lukwali lonumpeke nepani nga ngati loapia bandu bupundema pane. Mwihola mmiojuji, wala mwijogopa. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Mwanyogwini panapwaga, ‘Nendenda kuboka, lakini niihika kabee.’ Ana nee mmbaii, mwakabia ntoguli ndaba nyenda kwa Atati, ndaba Atati nkolongu kupeta nepani. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Numpwagi ganiaga sajenu kabula ngasegapitii, ili pagiipitila nhwesa kuhobale. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Nga nongee na mwanganya kabee majambu gingipi, ndaba lijobi kilongosi ju nndema goni jutenda kuhika. Lakini nepani ngasejunhwesa kundenda sindo, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>lakini bandu bupundema pani apalika kumanya naapai Atati, nane ndenda kila sindu ngati Atati heandumiki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Nzemaniya tubokaniya pambane!<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mzabibu wa sakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>“Nepani nunzabibu wa sakaka na Atati bangu ndi jojulema. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Kila limbandi nkati jangu langa kubeleka matunda jutenda kuliseku. Kila limbandi lelibeleka jutenda kulisekuli ili libelika ngani. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Mwanganya tayali mmbi sapi ndaba ja malobi ganumpwagi. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Ntama nkati jangu nanepani ndama nkati jii. Ngati helibii limbandi ngaseliwesa kupapa matunda kajika ana ngaselitemi mu nzabibu, ndi nanamu nganhwesi kupapa matunda bila kutama nkati jangu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>“Nepani nunzabibu, na mwanganya ndi mambandi. Jojutama nkati jangu, nanepani anami nkati jaki, hoju jupapa matunda gingipi, ndaba bila nepani nganhwesi kutenda sokapi sela. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Mundu jokapi ana ngasejutemi nkati jangu bundeke kunza ngati limbandi lebileke kunza nukujoma. Mambandi ngati haga bandu bagatondo nukugaleke kumotu ili gatinyika. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Ana ntemi nkati jangu na malobi gangu na gatemi nkati jinu, henu nndoba sokapi sempala mwitenda kupata. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Atati bangu atenda kulumbaliwa ana mpapiki matunda gingipi nukupete hela nkuba mwa banafunzi bangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Nenumpai mwanganya ngati Atati heambai nepani. Ntama muupali wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Ana nzetaki miilu jangu mwiitama muupali wangu, ngati nepani henyoani malagalaki ya Atati bangu nukutama mu upali waki.”<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>“Numpwagi majambu haga ili kutogule kwangu kutama nkati jino, nukutogule kwinu kukamilikaje. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Jenze ndi miilu jangu, mpalana ngati henumpai nepani mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Nga upali gogubi nkolongu ngani kupeta upali waka mundu kuguboa womi waki ndaba jaakosi baki. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Mwanganya mwibia mwaakosi bangu nantei ganundagalaki. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Mwanganya nga nunkemi mwaatumisi, ndaba ntumisi ngasejumanya sejuhenga nkolongu waki. Lakini nepani nunkemiki mwanganya mwaakakosi bangu, ndaba numanyisi goti ganyoini kuhuma kwa Atati bangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Mwanganya ngasemwahaagwi nepani, nepani nunhagwi mwanganya, nuntuma nnzenda mwakaabelika matunda gingi, matunda ganga kuhoba ndi mahengu ga sapi. Nabombi Atati awesa kumpeke sokapi semwaaloba kupete liina langu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Ndienu miilu jangu kwinu ndi jenze, mpalana.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu pundema bansuki banafunzi baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>“Ana bandu bupundema pani bunsuki mwanganya, nkombuka biibiya anzuki nepani kabula jukunsuki mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Ana mwakabii mwa bandu bupundema pani, bandu bupundema pani bakabiya bupai mwanganya ngati bandu babu, lakini ndaba mwanganya nga mwabandu bupundema pani ila nepani nuwagwi kuhuma pundema. Ndaba jahela bandu bupundema pani bunsuki mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Nkombuka ennupwaji ntumisi nga nkolongu kupeta bambu waki. Ana bandu andesiki nepani hata mwanganya bitenda kuntesa, ana ajetaki malobi gangu nepani bijetakiya malobi ginu mwanganya kabee. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Lakini ganaga goti bantendila mwanganya ndaba mwanganya mwabandu bango, ndaba ngasebumanyiki jombi jojundumiki. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ana nganakahikiki nukulonge nabu nabombi ngabakabii namahakao, lakini henu nganhwesi kupwaga ngase abii na mahakau. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Jojunzuki nepani, jaasuki kabee na Atati bango. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Ana nganakahengiki kwabu majambu gaguge mundu jokapi jojawaiki kuhenga ngabakabii na mahakao, lakini henu biibweni ndonduke yenahengiki anzuki nepani nakabee baasuki na Atati. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Majambu ge haga gapiti ili kutimisa gala gahandiki mu Malagalaki gabu, ‘Anzuki bwaka!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>“Pajihika Jojujangati hoju jonantuma kwinu kuhuma kwa Atati, hoju ndi Loho jaka Sapanga jojampwagila sakaka kuhusu Sapanga. Nantuma kwinu kuhuma kwa Atati najombi jinongaliya nepani. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Namwanganya kabee mwapwagila bandu kuhusu nepani, ndaba mwabii na nepani toka panatumbuliya lihengu langu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>“Numpwagi majambu goti haga ili mwikotoka kuhobale kwino. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Bandu bambenga mwanganya mma nyumba jukuketangane Ayaudi. Kabee sihika kipindi kila mundu jojwaankoma mwanganya jihambusiya anhenge lihengu Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Bantendila hela ndaba ngasebaamanyiki Atati wala nepani. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Lakini numpwagi mwanganya majambu haga, ili lisaa lee heliika mwingombuka nepani numpwagi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Mahengu ga Loho jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Ngasenumpwagi majambu haga toka panaatumbuliya kuketangana na mwanganya ndaba nabii pamu na mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Lakini henu nunzendee jojundumiki jola, na ngakuba hata jumu winu jojumbwagi nyenda kwaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Ndaba nepani numpwagi malobi haga, mioju jinu jibiniki ngamaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Lakini nepani numpwagi sakaka, nambanga kwinu nepani moka, ndaba anangasemokiki Jukujangatii hoju ngajwiiki kwino. Lakini anamokiki namtuma kwinu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Najombi ejwihika jwalangia bandu bupu ndema ngaseamanyi usakaka wa mahakau, usakaka wa gajupala Sapanga na usakaka wa na utemu waka Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Jaalangia usakaka wa mahakau, ndaba ngaseanhobale nepani, <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>jalangia usakaka wa gajupala Sapanga ndaba nepani nyenda kwa Atati. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Jaalangia usakaka kuhusu Sapanga kwaatemu bandu, ndaba nkolongu ju nndema goni juhukumiwi tayali.”<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>“Nakona mii na majambu gingi gukumpwagi, lakini nganhuwesi kugakamu goha. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Lakini pajwihika Loho jaka Sapanga jandongua muu sakaka woti kuhusu Sapanga. Ngajipwagi kupete uwesu waki mweni, ila jwipwaga gajwijoa kuhuma kwa Atati nukummanyisa gagihika. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Jombi jwinumbaliya nepani ndaba jagajukua ganalongi nepani nu kumpwaji mwanganya. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Yoti yeabinaku Atati ndi yangu. Ndi maana bwagiki Loho hoju jwijukua gagabii gangu nepani nukumanyisa mwanganya.”<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usungu nukutogule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>“Sakoni kipindi kisokopi pena mwanganya ngamwimone na kabee esipeta kipindi kisokopi mwindenda kumona kabee.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Banafunzi bangi balaluana, “Jubii na maana boo ejupwaaga, ‘Sakoni kipindi kisokopi mwanganya ngamwimoni na kabee sakoni kipindi kisokopi mwanganya mbaka mwiimoni?’ Kabee jubii na maana bole ejupwaaga, ‘Ndaba nyenda kwa Atate!’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Baendaliya kulaluana, jubii na maana bo ejupwaga, ‘Sakoni kipindi kisokope?’ Ngasetuelewa sejupwaga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesu jamanyiki apala kundaluki, ndienu jaapwagila, “Boo ndaluana le kupete ganapwaaga, ‘Sakona kipindi kisokopi ngamwimone, na esipeta kipindi kisokopi kabee mbaka mwimone?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Numpwagi Sakaka, mwanganya mwilela nukulobalake, lakini bandu bupunndema biitenda kutogulela. Mwibona usungu lakini usungu winuu wing'anumbuka mwitenda kutogulela. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Kipindi mmbomba ejuegale kubeleka mwoju gumbina ndaba lisaa lukubona usungu guhikiki. Lakini najubeliki tayali ngasejukomboka ndaba jukutogule mwana na jusaliwi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Nanamu kabee mbii nu ubini sajenu, lakini nanhikila kabee nanamu mwitenda kutogule mioju jinu nukutogule kweehoku nga mundu jojwiwesa kukuboa kutogulee kweehoku.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Lisoba le heli ngamwinobi sokapi. Numpwagi sakaka, sokapi semwaaloba Atati kwi liina langu, jombi jiitenda kumpeke. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Mbaka sajenu ngasenndobiki sokapi ku liina langu. Nndoba nanamu mbaka mpati ili kutogule kwinu kutimia.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu juguwesiki nndema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Numpwagi majambu haga sa malenganu, lisaa lihika nganilonge na mwanganya kwa malenganu kabee, lakini kipindi kihika nampwagila hotuhotu majambu ga Atati. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Lisoba le heli mwiloba kwi liina langu, ngasenumpwagi naaloba Atati badala jino. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Ndaba Atati beni bumpai mwanganya. Ndaba mwanganya mmbai nepani nukunhobale nepani nhumiki kwaka Sapanga, <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>nepani nhumiki kwa Atati, nukuhika kundema, henu nuuleka nndema nukukelabuki kwa Atati.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Ndienu banafunzi baki bumpwagila, “Henu gupwaga pagwendu sanga kutumii malenganu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Henu tumanyiki wehapa ugamanyiki majambu goti, wala nga kupalika mundu kulaluki maswali. Kwa majambu haga tuhobale sakaka guhumiki kwaka Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesu japwaaga, “Boo, sajenu lee nhobalela? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Kihika kipindi, kabee kihikiki pamwilekana kila mundu kujenda kunyumba jaki, nukuneka kajika jangu. Lakini nepani ngase mii kajika jangu ndaba Atati abii pamu na nepani. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Numpwagi majambu ge haga ili mbia nu lukwali mukujongana na nepani. Punndema pani mwipata mang'aliku lakini mulipekia makili. Ndaba nepani nagawesiki majambu gupu nndema!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaalobe banafunzi baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesu ejwajomula kupwaaga ganiaga, jalinga kunani kwaka Sapanga nukupwaaga, “Atati lisaa lela lihikike! Gumpekiya Mwana waku ukolongu ili najombi Mwana jugupekiya ukolongu. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Ndaba umpeki Mwana waku uwesu kwa bandu boti ili jwapekia womi wa masoba goa gaumpeki. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Na womi wa masoba goa ndi gongo, bandu bugumanya weapa kajika jaku ndi Sapanga wa sakaka na Yesu Kilisitu joguntumiki. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Nepani nugupeki ukolongu wehapa pundema nukujomo lihengu leumbeki kuhenga. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Henu mwa Atati mmbekya ukolongu palongi jaku sajenu, ngati ulumbi gola gonabii naku kabula jukubomba ndema.”<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>“Nugumanyisi kwa bandu boka baumbeki kundema. Babi bandu baku nawe wambekya abia bandu bangu, nabombi bilijoini lilobi laku. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Henu amanyiki hindu yoti yegumbeki ihumiki kwaku. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Nepani naapeki malobi gaumbeki nabombi bagajopikii. Henu amanya sakaka nhumiki kwaku na ahobali wehapa ndi joundumiki.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>“Naalobe bombi. Ngasenaalobe bandu bupundema ila naalobee bagumbeki, ndaba ndi baku. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Goka gami naku gaku, na gaku gangu, na ukolongu wangu gumanyikini kwa bandu bagumbeki. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Henu nhika kwaku, nganiendele kutama kabee mundema, lakini bamba biendaliya kutama mundema. Atati baa Sapi! Kwa makili giliina laku legumbeki, noba walinga, ili abia bamu ngati twepani etubi pamu. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Panabii pamu nabu, nepani naalendiki kupete makili giliina laku lewambeki. Nga mundu hata jumu jojuhobiki, ila pee jojahoba jola ili Maandiku gaa Sapi gatimia. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Ndienu nhika kwaku, nane mbwagiki majambu haga kundema, ili nabombi abiya mukutogule kwango. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Nepani naapeki lilobi laku, bandu bapandema batenda kwaasuki ndaba bombi ngabandu bupundema pane, ngati nepani hemi nga jupunnndemapani. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Ngasenoba waboa pundema, ila walonda kuhuma kwaka Mbaja jola yani Lijobi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Bombi nga bandu bupundema, ngati nepani ezindiki kuba upundema. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Wahenga abiya bandu baku baasapi kupete sakaka jaku, lilobi laku ndi la sakaka. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Ngati ewanduma nepani pundema, nane naatumiki bombi pundema. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Ndaba jabu nilipia namweti kwaku, ili na bombi ahelahe bilipia kwaku su usakaka.”<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Ngasenaalobe bombi kajika, ila naalobe kabee boti balababi nhobaliya kupete lilobi lango. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Noba ili boti abia bamu. Atati, noba abiya nkati jitu ngati wehapa egubii nkati jangu nane nkati jaku. Noba abiya bamu ili bandu bupundema ahobaliya wehapa ndi wogundumiki. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Nepani numpeki ukolongu agolago gogwambekiya nepani, ili abiya bamu ngati twee etubii pamu. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Nepani miya nkati jaku nawe nkati jango, noba wahenga abiya bamu ngani ili ndema gumanya gundei kunduma, nane napai bombi ngati egumbai nepane.”<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>“Atati! Mbala bagumbeki haba abiya pamu na nepani panguba, ili bugubona ukolongu wangu gogumbeki, ndaba watei kumbala kabula jukubomba nndema. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Atati ba amboni, bandu bupundema ngase bugumanyi, lakini nepani nugumanyiki. Haba nabombi amanyiki wehapa watei kunduma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Naatei bombi akumanya weapa na musiendaliya kuhenga aendalia kugumanya ili upali gogubinaku kwangu gubiya nkati jabu nane miya nkati jabu.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ayaudi ankamu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matei 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesu ejajomula kundoba Sapanga, jaboka na banafunzi baki balombuka kikoka suku Kidiloni. Pandupe pala sakabii kijongu, jombi Yesu na banafunzi baki bajingala homu. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yuda joa ang'anumbuka Yesu, japamanyiki pandu pala ndaba mala jingi Yesu jukubika juketangana na banafunzi baki. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Ndienu, Yuda jahika kukijongu pamu nu nsambi wa alonda bikilumi na alonda ba Nyumba jaka Sapanga kuhuma kwaka Agolu na Afalisayu bababia baatumiki, babii na haya ya miotu ni ibonga na hindu yukukomane. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Ndienu Yesu jojabia jumanyiki goti gagampata jaahegaliya nakaalaluki, “Boo muntaputa nyanee?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Nabombi bapwaga, “Yesu juku Nazaleti!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu jaapwagila, “Ndi nepane!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yuda joang'anambuka Yesu jajemiki papuje pamu nabu. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Ndienu Yesu jaapwagila, “Ndi nepane,” bakelubuka kunyuma nukuhabuka pai. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesu jaalalukiya kabee, “Muntaputa nyane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Nabombi bumpwagila, “Yesu juku Nazaleti!”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yesu japwaagila, “Ne numpwagi ndi nepani. Ndienu ngati nndaputa nenga, mwaaleka banganya ajendannya.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Japwaaga haga ili gatimia gabapwaaga, “Atati, bawambeki bala ngasenahoiki hata jumu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simoni Petili jojabii nu upanga, jaholumula, anunkula likutu luku malele ntumi waka Nngolu Nkolongu. Ntumi we hoju ankemika Malukusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesu ampwagila Petili, “Kelubua mpamba waku munhaku waki. Boo niikunywa le kikombi sukung'alika seambeki Atate?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bumpeleka kwaka Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Nsambi wa alonda pamu na kilongosi jaalonda bikilumi bumkamula Yesu, nukunkonga, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>batumbuliya kumpeleka kwaka Anasi, na Anasi jabiya nkowanu waka Kayafa jojuwe jojabii nngolu nkolongu wa saka sela. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kayafa we hoju ndi jojabiya jaapwagila Ayaudi nambanga mundu jumu kuwa ndaba ja bandu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matei 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maluko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simoni Petili na banafunzi bangi bumpwata Yesu. Mmbolee jongi jabiya jumanyikana kuku Nngolu Nkolongu, ndienu jajenda pamu na Yesu nkati ja hua jaka Nngolu Nkolongu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Lakini Petili jabiya jujemiki kunza pambipi ni litanga. Ndienu, mmbole jongi we hoju jojabiya jumanyikana kwaka Nngolu Nkolongu japita nukulongee nu ntumisi mmbomba, jojuhenga lihengu lukuhogo nukupunga litanga anzingia Petili nkati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Mmbomba we jola andalukiya Petili, “Boo wehapa le nga jumu wa banafunzi baka mundu hajojo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Petili ampwagila, “Ngasenummanyi mundu we hojo!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Atumi na alonda babiya anyata mwotu ndaba sabii kipepu, babiya akoiki papuje. Najombi Petili jabiya jujemiki pamu nabu bakanyata mwotu.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu palongi jaka Nngolu Nkolongu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matei 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Kipindi aselase, Nngolu Nkolongu jabiya andaluki Yesu majambu ga banafunzi baki na mabolee gaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesu japwaaga, “Nongee pagwendu mbeli ja bandu boti. Masoba goti molika mu Nyumba juku ketangane Ayaudi nu ku Nyumba jaka Sapanga, papuje Ayaudi boti paaketangane ngasenapwaga lijambu lokapi puujobu. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Ndaba jakii kunaluki nepane? Walalukiya babajoannya naapwagila ki. Bombi ndi amanyiki ganaapwagila.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesu pajajomula kupwaaga haga, nndonda jumu jojabii jujemiki papu andapula Yesu likopi kumihu koni jupwaaga, “Boo ndi le egumpwagi Nngolu Nkolongo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Ana ngati mbwagiki liyaa, langia uliya wene kwa bando, lakini na mbwagiki sapi, mbona gunapula?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Ndienu, Anasi ampelika Yesu koni ankongiki kwaka Nngolu Nkolongu Kayafa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili ankana kabee Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matei 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maluko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Simoni Petili jabiya jakoni jakanyata mwotu, andalukiya, “Boo wehapa le nga jumu ja banafunzi bake?” Jombi jakana kukupwaaga, “Nganenga!”<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Ntumisi jumu jwaka Nngolu Nkolongu, ndongu waka mundu joansekula Petili likutu, andalukiya, “Boo, nepani ngasenugubweni kukijongu kola pamu na Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Petili japwaaga kabee, “Ngahela” Apalapa likongobi latenda kubeka.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu palongi jaka Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Ndienu pakwahika pulukela bunzukua Yesu kuhuma kwaka Kayafa, nukumpeleka ku kunyumba ju ubambu lu ukolongu la Aloma. Lakini bombi ngasebajingala nkati ndaba bii kuba apija ila abiya sapi palongi jaka Sapanga ili awesa kula Lisoba lukutogule Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Ndienu Pilatu japita kunza kobabii, jalalukiya, “Muntaki jubii na magambu boo mundu we hojo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Bombi bumpwagila, “Ana mundu we hoju jakabia ngasejuhengiki uliyaa ngatukunndetiki kwako.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilatu ampwagila, “Ndienu munzukua mwanganya mukuntemula kukupwata Malagalaki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Ayaudi bapwagila, “Twepani ngasetubii nu uwesu uku kutemu mundu jokapi jukuwa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Gahengika hela ili gatimia Malobi ga Sapi gajapwaga Yesu kulangi jiikuwa kwi indela boo.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilatu jajingala kabee nkati ja nyumba jaki, ankema Yesu nukundaluki, “Boo, wehapa lee wa Bambu Nkolongu wa Ayahude?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesu japwaaga, “Boo, ganiaga le malobi gaku au bandu bangi agupwagi majambu gango?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilatu jaapwagila, “Boo, ne lee nga nu Nhyahude? Bandu baku naka agolu aguletiki kwa minepani. Gutei kyane?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Ukolongu wa minepani nga gundema gone. Ukolongu wane wakabii gupundema gongo apwasi bangu bakabia anyangati biingamu aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi. Lakini henu Ubambu Ukolongu wangu nga waapane.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Papuje Pilatu japwaagila, “Ndienu, wehapa le wa Bambu Nkolongu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu jaapwagila, “Wehapa gupwaiki nepani na Bambu Nkolongu. Nepani melikwi ndaba ja majambu haga, na kwa ndaba heji nhikiki pundema kaapwagi bandu majambu ga Sakaka. Kila mundu jojupala sakaka jutenda kunyoane.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilatu ampwagila, “Sakaka ndi sindu bole?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu antemula kuwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matei 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maluko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilatu ejajomula kupwaaga lilobi heli, japita kabee kunza nakaapwagi Ayaudi. “Nepani ngasenilibweni likosa lokapi laka mundu we hojo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Lakini kila saka nhyobali nepani, nunhogule mpungwa jumu kipindi sukutogule Pasaka. Boo, mpala nunhoguliya nkolongu jwa Ayahude?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Papuje bajamaliya, “Nga hojo, ila utuhoguliya Balaba!” Najombi Balaba jakabii jojanyaga bandu hindu.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Ndi Pilatu jalagalakiya, bunzukua Yesu nubundapula iboko. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Akamanzolinzoli baloka seketule ja miha bunhwatika Yesu kumutu, nukunhwatika lingobu la zambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Babiya ahika palongi jaki nukupwaaga, “Jambuoti! Bambu Nkolongu wa Ayaudi!” Koni akundapula makopi kumihu.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilatu japita kunza kabee nukupwa, “Nndinga nundeta kabee kwinu ili mmanya nepani ngasenugubweni uliya wokapi kwaki.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Ndienu, Yesu japitila kunza juweti seketule ja miha na ingobu ja langi ja zambalau juu bambu. Pilatu ampwagila, “Nndinga, mundu we jonzone!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Agolu akolongu na alonda pabumbona batenda kujamaliya, “Umbambaliya punsalaba! Mumbambaliya puunsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilatu jaapwagila, “Munzukua mwabee mukumbambaliya punsaba, nepani ngasenilibweni lihakau lokape kwaki.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Ayaudi bapwaaga, “Twe tubii na Malagalaki gitu, na kwa Malagalaki ge haga mundu we hoju kupalika kukomeka, ndaba julikema Mwana waka Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilatu ejajoa haga, jajogopa ngani. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Jajingala kabee pa nyumba ju ubambu ukolongu nukundaluki Yesu, “Wehapa guhumi kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Lakini Yesu ngasejapwaaga lilobi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Ndienu Pilatu ampwagila, “Wehapa gukana le kulongee na nenga? Ngasegumanyiki le minu uwesu gukugulekake au kugubambali punsalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesu japwaga, “Wehapa nga wakabii nu uwesu wokapi kwangu nepani ananga ngawakapatiki kuhuma kwaka Sapanga. Henu jojunetiki kwaku wehapa hoju ndi jubii na kihakau kikolongu nakanopi?”<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Tumbuka hapa, Pilatu jabiya jutaputa indela jukundekake Yesu lakini Ayaudi batenda kujamali, “Ana gundekaki mundu ajo, wehapa nga gunkosi waka bambu nkolongu juku Loma, kila mundu jojilikema bambu nkolongu ankana bambu nkolongu juku Loma.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Pilatu ejajoa malobi gala andeta Yesu kunza jatama pumpandu waki gukutemu, pandu pabapakema lubanza lwa malibu, kwi kiebulania akema Gabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Lisoba le heli labiya lukuandaa Pasaka, pambipi ni lisaa la sita lioba mutu. Pilatu jaapwagila Ayaudi, “Ndinga, Bambu Nkolongu winu ajo!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Bajamaliya, “Munkoma! Munkoma! Gumbambaliya punsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilatu andalukiya, Mpala le numbambaliya Nkolongu wi pu nsalaba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Akolongu ba agolu bajibua, “Twepani nganu nkolongu jongi ila nkolongu juku Loma.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Ndipala Pilatu ampia Yesu kwabu ili bummbambaliya punsalaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu buntenda kumbambali pu nsalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-42">Luka 23:26-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ndienu alonda bunzukua Yesu <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yesu jaboka jutotwi nsalaba waki, baboka kujendane pandu pabapakema, “Lihupa lu umutu,” kwi kiebulania akukema ku Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Pabumbambaliya Yesu punsalaba, pamu najombi bapumbambaliya punsalaba na bandu bangi abeli babambaliya pumisalaba jabu, jumu kumangega na jongi kumalele kwaka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilatu jaaandika kibau sekisomeka, “Yesu juku Nazaleti Bambu Nkolongu jwa Ayahude.” Panani ju nsalaba waka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Ayaudi bingi basoma kibau se hesi, ndaba pandu pabummbambaliya Yesu pakabii pambipi na Musi. Kabee kibau se hesi sabiya aandiki kwi kiebulania ni kilatini ni kigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Ndienu Agolu Akolongu ba Ayaudi bumpwagila Pilatu, “Wiihandika, ‘Bambu Nkolongu wa Ayaudi, ila andika ana, mundu jonzo japwaaga, nepani na Bambu Nkolongu wa Ayaudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilatu japwaaga, “Ganhandiki, ndi handiki!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Alonda pababiya ammbambalii Yesu, bajukua ingobu yaki babaga mapungu nsesi, lipungu limu kwaka kila mlonda. Bajukua kabee kanzu jaki, kanzu je jela jabia alenganaki kukitambaa simu bila lutotu. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Bapwagannya, “Twijendu ila tupega gudugudu ili tumanya jujukuu nyaa.” Haga ndi gabahenga aka alonda bala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Babagana ingobu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na kanzu jangu bakinila gudugudu.” Ndi hebahenga aka alonda.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Pambipi nu nsalaba waka Yesu, babiya ajemiki na amabu baki, na nndombu wa amabu na Malia nhwanu waka Kileopa, na Malia juku Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesu ejaabona amabu baki, ajemiki pamu nu mbolee joampai, jajema pambipi nakapwaagi amabu, “Amabo, nndinga hoju ndi mwana wako.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Ndipala ampwagila mmbole jola, “Linga aba ndi amabu baku.” Tumbuka lisaa lela mmbolee jaajukua nukujenda kutama naku kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matei 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Yesu ejabona goti gatimii, na ili Maandiku ga Sapi gatimia japwaaga, “Nilijoane nywita.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Papuje kwabii na sombu sekitweli divai jejibabiki. Ndienu batobakiya kipongu divai jejibabiki, bakonga panani julundonga lunkongu wa hisopu, nukumbeke pundomu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesu ebumpekia divai je jela, japwaaga, “Goka gatimie!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Ndipala jajinamisa mmutu, nakuwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu buntonga nkoa muluteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Ndaba kwabiya lisoba lukuandaa tipati ja Pasaka, Ayaudi ngasebapai nhyega ihigaliya punsalaba Lisoba lu Kupomulela, ndaba lisoba le heli labii Lisoba lu Kupomulela. Aka kilongosi ba Ayaudi bundoba Pilatu magolu ga bandu baabambaliwi bala bijitunula na nhyega yabu biiboa punsalaba ndaba lisoba le heli labia likolongu lakajika. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Ndienu alonda bajenda ili baatunula magolu gaka mundu ja kwanza jojakomika pamu na Yesu na jongi we jola kabee. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Lakini ebunhikila Yesu, bunkolila juwile, ndienu ngasebatunula magolu gaki. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Lakini nndonda jumu antonga nkoa muluteta Yesu apalapa wapita mwai na masi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Mundu jojagabweni majambu ge haga ndi jojapwaaga hotuhotu ili nanamu nhwesa kuhobale, na malobi gajapwaaga ga sakaka. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Lijambu le heli lihengiki ili Maandiku ga Sapi gatimia, “Nga lihupa laki hata limu leliitunuka.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Kabee Maandiku gangi gapwaaga, “Bandingaliya jobaantonga nkoa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atenda kuntaga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Egajomuka haga, Josepu juku Alimatayo andoba Pilatu anzetakiya kuhulu nhyega jaka Yesu kuhuma punsalaba. Josepu jabiya mmbole waka Yesu, lakini sanga bandu kumanya ndaba jajogopa aka akolongu buku Uyahudi. Ndienu Pilatu anzetakiya, ndienu Josepu jajenda nukuhulu nhyega jaka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Josepu jalongini na Nikodemu jojuwe jawahiki kunzende Yesu ikilu, jahika nukuleta mahuta gabagakema manemane gahangangini nu ubani kilu selasini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Ndienu bandu abeli bajukua nhyega jaka Yesu, bakonga ingobu nhuu pamu na mahuta ngati ebayobali kutaga Ayaudi. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Pandu paakomila Yesu pakabii ni kijongu, ni kijongu se hesi kwabii lipoli linyai lelabii ngasebawaiki kuntagi mundu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Ndienu, ndaba labi lisoba la Ayaudi kulibeka sapi ndaba ji Lisoba lu Kupomulela, na ndaba lipoli le lakabii pambipi, bummbeka Yesu momuje.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu juyokiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matei 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Lisoba la jumapili pulukela, ekwabiya kwakona nga na kusaki, Malia juku Magidala jajenda ku lipole. Ejahika kola jilikolila lilibu lebayekali lipole lela aliboiki. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Ndienu jajenda imbelu kwaka Simoni Petili na mmbole jongi jojuwe Yesu ampaliki ngamaa, jaapwagila, “Amboiki Bambu mu litenge, wala ngasetumanyiki koambeile.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Ndipala Simoni Petili na mmbolee jongi jola bajendannya kulitenge. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Boti abeli babia abutukani lakini jongi jola jabia jubutuka kupeta Petili, jalonguliya kuhika ku lipole. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Jajinama nukulingali nkati, jijibona ingobu nhuu seahingalaki nhyega jaka Yesu lakini ngasejajingala nkate. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simoni Petili najombi jahika munyuma jaki nu kujingii mlipoli momuje jikibona ingobu nhuu jela. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Ni kitamba sebabia anyonalati Yesu kumutu. Kitambaa se hesi abei patali na sanda, ila sabia kitulwini kibii pakajika jaki. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Ndienu mmbolee waki jojalonguliya kuhika kulipoli jola najombi jajingala nkati nukubona itamba ye bahingalati nhyega jaka Yesu, nukuhobale. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Babia bakoni ngakuelewa Maandiku ga Sapi egapwaga kwabi, jupalika juyoka. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Ndipala banafunzi bala babujaniya kumajumba gabu.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ampiti Malia juku Magadala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matei 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maluko 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Malia juku magadala jabia jujemiki kunza jilipoli jakalela. Ejwabiya jakoni jakalela jajinama nukulinga nkati jilipoli, <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>jaabona atumi abeli bu kunani baka Sapanga aweti ingobu iyuu, atamani pababei nhyega jaka Yesu pwabiya ajigoniki, jumu upandi ukumutu na jongi upandi wa kwamagolu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Bundalukiya, “Nyongoo gulele kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Na Malia jaapwagila “Amboiki Bambu wango na wala ngasenukumanyiki koambeile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Malia pajajomula kupwaga haga, njang'anumbuka munyuma ambona Yesu jujemiki, lakini ngaseamanyike ngati jombi ndi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Nyongoo, gulele kike? Guntaputa nyane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Malia jaholaliya julongee na jojuhenga lihengu lukulingali kijongu, ampwagila, “Nkolongu, ana gumboiki wehapa gumbwagila kogumbeile nane nukunzukuaje.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Malia!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Ndipala Malia anng'anambukiya Yesu nu kulongee naku kwi kiebulania, “Laboni!” Maana jaki Mmbola.<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Wingamu, nakonaa ngasembiti kunani kwa Atati. Lakini jenda kwaka alongu bangu ukaapwagila, nyenda kunani kwaka Sapanga kwa Atati bangu na Atati binu, Sapanga wangu na ndi Sapanga winu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Ndienu Malia juku Magidala jajenda kaapwagi majambu gala banafunzi kupwaga ambweni Bambu, najabiya ampwagi malobi haga.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaapiti banafunzi baki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Kwabiya pakamii ji lisoba alelale la juma pili, banafunzi baki pababiya pamu nkati ju nyumba, milyangu babia apungiki ndaba jakajogopa akakiliongosi ba Ayaudi, Yesu jaapitila, jajema pikilanda jabu nukupwaaga, “Lukwali lubiya kwinu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Ejajomula kupwaga haga, jaalangia maboku gaki nu luteta lwaki. Banafunzi baki batogulii ngamaa pabummbona Bambu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesu jaapwagila kabee, “Lukwali lubiya kwinu! Ngati Atati ebantuma nepani, nane numtuma mwanganya.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Najombi ejajomula kupwaaga haga, jaapulaliya loho nakaapwagi, “Nzoopannya Loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Anamwalekaki bandu mahakau gabu, alekakiwi, anangakaalekake, ngabilekakiwe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Lakini Tomasi, jobunkema, “Lipaa,” Jojabii jumu ja banafunzi baki komi na abeli, ngasejabii pamu nabu kipindi Yesu ejahika. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Henu banafunzi bangi bumpwagila, “Tumbweni Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Lakini jombi Tomasi jaapwagila, “Anangakagabona mabanga gi misumali mumaboku gaki nukubeka lukonzi lwagu mumabanga gimisumali nukuboku kwaku muluteta jaki, nganhobalele.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Egapeta masoba nani banafunzi baki babiya kabee pamu mu nyumba, najombi Tomasi jabii pamu naku. Ndienu Yesu jahika koni milyangu apungiki nu kujema pikilanda jabu nukupwaaga, “Lukwali lubiya kwinu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Ndipala ampwagila Tomasi, “Beka lukonzi lwaku pambani gulinga maboku gangu, nyosa kuboku kwaku gulinga muluteta lwangu. Kotuka kuba ni kiholu, ila guhobaliya.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomasi ampwagila, “Bambu wangu na Sapanga wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Boo gunhobali le egumwene? Nambanga banga kubona, lakini ahobale.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndaba jukuandika kitabu senze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesu jatenda nginyuli nga yeyo mbeli ja banafunzi baki, yeyuye ngaseaandiki mukitabu senzeno. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Lakini ganiaga aandiki ili nnwesa kunhobale Yesu ndi Kilisitu Nkombosi, Mwana waka Sapanga, na sukunhobale jombi, mwanganya mwiipata womi wa masoba goa kwa makili gi liina laki.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaapitii banafunzi saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Pagapeta ganiaga Yesu jaapitila kabee banafunzi baki mulutengu ju nhanga guku Tibelia. Jaapitila ana, <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simoni Petili na Tomasi joankema mapaa na Nataneli mwenei juku Kana Galilaya na bana abeli baka Zebedayu na banafunzi baki bangi abeli, babia boti abeli pamu. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simoni Petili jaapwagila, “Nyenda kulobo homba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Nabombi bumpwagila, Natwe ngiti tulongana nawenga, ndienu bajenda nukukwela nhwatu, lakini ikilu je heji ngasebapatiki sokape. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Ekwatumbuliya kukusa, Yesu jajema mulutengu ju nhanga, lakini banafunzi baki ngasemanyiki ndi ngati jombe. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Ndienu, Yesu jaalalukiya, “Akosi bangu ngasempatiki le sokape?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Bombi bapwaaga, “Loo! Ngasetupatiki sindo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nndekala ilepa hinu upandi wa malele uku nhwatu ngiti mpata homba.” Ndienu balekala kilepa mu nhanga lakini ngasebawesa kuhuta kabee ndaba ja homba kuba hinge.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Papuje mmbolee jojapaliki na Yesu ampwagila Petili, “Jonzo Bambu!” Simoni Petili pajajoa Bambu, jakonga ingobu jaki ndaba jabiya ndaba ngaese jwakongike ingobo, nukuhombe mmase. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Lakini banafunzi bangi bala bahika ku mbwani ku nhwatu gola koni ahuta ilepa yeitweli homba, ngasebabii kutali nukundema, ila babiya utali wa meta miya kuhuma mulutengu. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Pabahika kundema bugubona mwotu wa makalakala akohiki na panani jaki abei homba ni libumunda. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nndeeta pamba homba yengi yendobwi yene.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simoni na Petili bakwela munhwatu, jahuta mbaka mundema gola kilepa sesabii homba ngolongu mia moja hamsini ni itatu. Papuje baabii bandu bingi ndienu kilepa se ngasewajendwike. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nhikannya nkula.” Ngajabii hata jumu jojawesa kundaluki sokapi. “We wa nyane.” Ndaba bumanyiki jombi ndi Bambu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesu jahika, jajukua libumunda, jaapekiya, jahenga ahelahe na homba yela.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Papuje jabiya mala ji itatu Yesu jaapitila banafunzi baki baada juku yoka.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Ebajomula kula, Yesu andalukiya simoni Petili, “Simoni mwana waka Yohana! Boo gumbai nepani kuliku banganya ababa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Najombi jaapwagila, “Ena Bambu, gumanyiki nepani nugupaile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu ampwagila, “Gulima bana ba makondoo gangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Ndipala ampwagila mala ja pili, “Simoni mwana waka Yohana! Boo, gumbaile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Petili ampwagila, “Ena Bambu gumanyiki nendenda kugupala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu ampwagila, “Gulima makondoo gangu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Andalukiya mala ja tatu, “Simoni mwana waka Yohana! Boo gumbaile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Papuje Petili jayomika ndaba andalukiya mala ja tatu. “Gumbaile?” Ampwagila, “Bambu, wehapa wagamanyi goti, wehapa gumanyiki nepani nde kugupala.” Yesu ampwagila, “Gulima makondoo gangu!” <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Sakaka nugupwagi, pawabii gunkombu wayobali kukonga luhunga nukujenda kwokapi kogupai. Lakini pawibiya gunseja gwitondabia maboku gaku, na mundu jongi jagukonga nukugupeleka kwanga kupala kujenda. <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Kukupwaga hela, Yesu jalangia Petili ejikuwa nukundumbalii Sapanga. Ndipala ampwagila, “Nyengaliya.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nu mmbolee jongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Papuje Petili jang'anambuka, ambona mmbolee jojabii Yesu ampai, jujengalee, mmbolee jola ndi jojabii kipindi sela sebabiya bakakula kilebi sa pakamii, jatemi pambipi ngamaa na Yesu nukundaluki, “Bambu nya jojwagung'anambuka?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Ndienu, Petili eambona hoju, andalukiya Yesu, “Bambu, na jonzo boo?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Ana ngati jupai juhigaliya mbaka panihika, gupala kyane? We gumbwata nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Ndienu, majambu ge haga gaeniya kwa bandu babuhobale Kilisitu kupwaaga mmbolee hoju ngajiikuwi. Lakini Yesu ngasejapwagiki mmbolee we hoju ngajukuwe ila japwaaga pe, “Ana ngati mbala juhigala mbaka panikelubuka, we gupala kyane?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Hoju ndi jojagabona majambu ge haga, nukuandika. Natwee tumanyiki gajapwaga ndi ga sakaka.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kujomulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Gabii majambo gingi gajahenga Yesu. Gaguge ngati gakahandikwi goti, limu baada ja lengi, nholale hata ndema weni ngakwakabii kwiibeka itabu yeyabii iyandikwi.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
